L24_1[2] = L26_1
L25_1 = {}
L26_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_LOTUS_C_KNUCKLE"
L27_1 = [[
Fatima Jamil adheres to her own interpretation of justice and employs trust and loyalty as her weapon. After subduing the Lotus crime syndicates, she joined the Administration in order to gain the authority to adjudicate injustice beyond the confines of the law, which had become ineffective.
However, she never abuses her authority of the Administration. She believes that the Administration's leaders are the only individuals capable of making moral decisions and follows their directives.
Of course, she does not believe that the Administration's choices are absolute and is unafraid to offer advice to her inexperienced superiors.
People have preconceived notions about Fatima due to her fierce appearance, but in reality, she is composed, thoughtful, and shows kindness toward children.]]
L25_1[1] = L26_1
L25_1[2] = L27_1
