L37_1 = "With her perfect memory and the mirror, she imitates other Six Wings members' skills. When afflicted with Skill Seal, performs an enhanced attack to a ground target in front by concentrating her strength and unleashing a powerful slash. The enhanced attack deals barrier-disabling AoE damage, causing Histun to targets even with immunity to Hitstun from Special or lower skills. She herself becomes immune to Hitstun from Special or lower skills and immune to CC◇ during the enhanced attack. The enhanced attack reduces Ultimate Skill's cooldown by 20 seconds."
