L44_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SIXWING_CA_ACTOR"
L45_1 = [[
Swan Claire is a mysterious actress from Charade.
She sweeps all the awards at film festivals each year and is regarded as an actress with a thousand faces who has a natural ability of understanding scripts and artistic performance. She is famous for being an actress who keeps her private life hidden from the public, enough so to have rumors floating around about paparazzi who follow her going missing shortly after.
Due to her mysteriousness, malicious scandals break out every year, but she seems unconcerned about them. As once said in an official interview with Swan's agency, she always appears as elegant and graceful like a swan in front of the public.
Recent intel from a reliable source suggests that she is associated with an organization called Six Wings.
However, her true identity and motives remain unclear.]]
L43_1[1] = L44_1
