L26_1 = [[
Morgana is a powerful Helgon who wields a weapon the size of her body.
Born with a horn due to the Corruption, people looked at her with fear. However, she wanted to be acknowledged for who she is and decided to work hard for everyone's recognition instead of going into hiding.
Morgana eventually became the leader of the Stump's survey corps, and was recognized for who she was rather than just her horn.
In times of crisis, her boldness gives others the impression that she is more mature than she looks. However, she is still a child who cannot resist the temptation of delicious grapes.]]
