L30_1 = [[
Mordred is a Helgon with the power of light.
When she was young, her potential as a Helgon was exceptional enough for a Cardinal to take Mordred under her wing.
With her outstanding shooting skills and strong sense of justice, she seemed to live up to the Order's expectation of becoming a paladin. But in a moment's notice, that expectation turned into betrayal.
One mistake made her a sinner and she broke out of prison before facing punishment. After that, no one in Elysion has ever seen her again.]]
