L5_1 = [[
"The Jackal is coming.", is the most feared phrase among the pirates wandering the Counterside. It is customary for pirates to flee to a safe hideout on days they obtain valuable loot, rather than celebrating. For when the lady who knows everything about the Underground becomes interested in the treasure, it will no longer be theirs.
The Jackal never lets anything that she has decided to own slip her grasp. Did you hear about how Reaper Industries, an emerging military company aiming to dominate the global arms market, suffered a crushing blow and went bankrupt shortly after rumors spread that they had obtained an Artifact known as [Parasite]? Several company CEOs are aware that this incident occurred as a result of one individual's desire to collect.
The Collector's most prized possession, [Parasite], is said to be rapidly evolving. It is assumed that the recent experience gained while observing the Scavengers' leader acted as a reference.]]
