L23_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_KNIGHT_CA_SAVIOR"
L24_1 = [[
Nehemoth Ray is a defender who specializes in protecting allies by countering enemies' attacks on himself and his rear allies.
In the distant past, a commoner boy in the Empire accidentally became the Savior and set out on a journey to save the world with the knights. The Empire's subjects all believed that he was the one to save the world, and the boy also made it his duty to do so.
After a long time, the empire eventually fell and no more subjects were left to save. However, the boy was unable to give up his journey to save the world because he could not let the expectations of those who hoped for salvation perish in vain.
Eons have passed, and now this kind boy who was once hailed as the Savior finally came to realize. That the end of the journey to salvation is only for him to become an invader himself and destroy another world.]]
L22_1[1] = L23_1
L22_1[2] = L24_1
L23_1 = {}
L24_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_KNIGHT_C_EMPEROR"
L25_1 = "Clareth El Arcadena is a striker with high base stats who excels in battling multiple enemies at once.\n\nHe is a well-rounded individual, serving as both the Empire of Arcadena’s crown prince who succeeded the Dragon Blood, and a member of the Knights of Redemption. Concerns about his arrogant personality turned out no need to be considered while he was handling government affairs on behalf of the ailing emperor. People were also convinced that the empire would prosper more than ever before under his leadership.\nNevertheless, the Empire's history did not allow Clareth to usher in a period of peace."
L23_1[1] = L24_1
L23_1[2] = L25_1
L24_1 = {}
L25_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_FALLEN_CA_ROSARIA"
L26_1 = [[
Asmodeus Rosaria le Friede is a sniper that deals more devastating damage to a single target.
In the past, she had ruthless and violent nature and turned all who stood in her path to ashes. As the ashes spread, notorious rumors of her existence began to circulate. Also known as the Tyrant of the North or the Queen of the Ashes, she had been challenged by many. However, none of them survived against her wielding one sword only.
Legend has it that one day, she rose from her own throne and vanished after no foe could match her strength. She is said to have set out on her own to search a worthy opponent who could satisfy her.]]
L24_1[1] = L25_1
L24_1[2] = L26_1
