L12_1 = [[
The gentle sea breeze felt pleasant, and your walk lasted longer than you had expected.
You were strolling through the sunlight and shade, following the familiar scent of grapes,
when your gaze stopped at the end of the beach-side path.
The woman held out a glass as if it were fate, and that was the beginning of an unforgettable summer.

<color=#ffd34c>This isn't a prophecy. We were destined to meet.</color>]]
