L13_1 = [[
I was drawn by the flashy fireworks and unintentionally participated in a festival.
I walked away from her to get some drinks, then...
I found out that the festival was for couples.
I was concerned that she would've felt awkward, but I could see her blushing with a slight smile on her face.

<color=#ffd34c>So what? Today, you and I are not just bartenders and customers.</color>]]
