L30_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_MOTHER"
L31_1 = [[
Moena is a strong woman living in a small fishing village. She's also the doting mother of Mone.
She can do anything for her village and her daughter. She's sorry that she cannot support Mone enough, but Mone is so proud of her mother that she doesn't care.
On the other hand, her naturally youthful beauty is an object of envy from even the most refined tourists from cities. Her secret to beauty is her coconut cream, whose recipe has been passed down in her family for generations. Being the generous matriarch that she is, Moena happily shares her cream with others. That alone is a good enough reason for her daughter to be proud of her, isn't it?]]
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_REPLACER_LOOK"
L32_1 = [[
Replacer Rook is a type of human-based bio-computer that is kept by Replacer Syndicate.
Her main features include spatial coordinate calculation and limited interference using its large-scale system, but she is thought to be capable of many more tasks on top of these. The reason for her absence in Terraside, despite her ability to be a great asset to Replacer Syndicate, is still being theorized.
On one hand, perhaps because of her need to allocate so much of her resources to her main features, her physical prowess, aside from her brain, is rather lackluster and ineffective compared to her peers. On the other hand, she also demands a specialized diet, citing her need for special nutrients.]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
