L35_1 = [[
A Nordnavik officer. Born in the capital and once lauded as the next Royal Chief Technician, she now works as a Technical Instructor for the border guard on the outskirts. Due to her reserved demeanor and fierce appearance, many perceive her to be an unapproachable superior. However, the reason the soldiers' ancient equipment and facilities continue to function is all thanks to her care.
There is also a rumor that she tends to hum when she works alone.]]
