L41_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_REAPER_C_ARMS"
L42_1 = [[
Lenore is an executive who belongs to the Northern Union Special Ops Team. She risked her life and volunteered to be a test subject in the Oracle project, a project her father was researching, and was the only subject to get successful results. She was able to see the future she wanted through the experiment and made significant contributions to the Northern Union by eliminating traitors within.
There was no such thing as failure for Lenore, who relied on her foresight abilities, and her ego grew bigger by the day. As time passed, she lost interest in the obvious results of the plans she had made.
She started looking for new and exciting things and soon discovered the joy of stomping on enemies who had strong beliefs. She originally completed missions to serve her country, but somewhere along the line, her missions morphed into self-indulgent crimes focused on bringing ruin to others.]]
