L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_SYSOP"
L33_1 = [[
Chairman of the Dark Council, a coalition of the underworld rulers. Although he has several notorious villains serving under him, his identity remains a mystery, which has led to numerous rumors.
Some consider the Council to be an urban legend, as they cannot fathom these unruly criminals serving under a single leader.
However, Sysop does indeed exist.
The fact that he makes no effort to govern or control these criminals is, if anything, overlooked in the people's speculation. He simply calculates causality and adjusts the process to achieve his desired result.
Thus, no one is in charge of the Dark Council. Only ambitious people and their advisors make up this group.]]
