L24_1 = [[
It's probably the first time I've written you a letter, Boss.
It's your birthday today, right? Happy birthday.
I'm terrible at writing letters, so I'm not sure what to say to make you happy,
but just know that I really mean it.
Today's a day of celebration.
You should be getting happy birthday wishes and eating delicious food.
That way, you may briefly forget about your troubles and concerns for a while.
So, I hope you have a lovely day today, okay?
<color=#ffd34c>- Yoo Mina -</color>]]
