L19_1 = {}
L20_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_CANARY_STAFF"
L21_1 = [[
Everyone wants to be the center of attention on the Gauntlet stage.
Unlike the players who fight on the battlefield, staff members work backstage, and their job isn't the most sought-after. However, even the top players cannot perform at their best without backup support.
Malena Skinner was a staff member for a formidable team that ranked among the top 10 teams in the league.
No one knows why she suddenly chose to abandon that career to join a new team, but one thing is certain.
As long as she is a part of the staff, Canary Squad will be able to perform to its full potential.]]
L19_1[1] = L20_1
L19_1[2] = L21_1
L20_1 = {}
L21_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JAPAN_C_CRAFTER"
L22_1 = [[
Nao is a descendant of an old god. She was a shy blacksmith who didn't come out of her forge because she didn't like interacting with others.
Her father's power used to hold the world up, but when it collapsed, her world was engulfed in never-ending flames. That was when she had to unexpectedly take on the responsibility of leading the survivors.
It was the chance of a lifetime for her to encounter the Administration. The encounter helped her to grow and properly lead her people, and also helped her lose the disgraceful name of "God Who Fears Death."
Since the Old Administration fell apart, she took a step back from the front lines and has been searching for a worthy individual who could inherit her smithing skills. However, she will always come to aid if the world were to be in danger.]]
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
