L30_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_ALT_CA_SEO_YOON_RECITAL"
L31_1 = [[
We crawled all the way up from the bottom.
We plucked and pulled at the strings by ourselves in a world that had no audience.
But now, we're surrounded by harmony, people.
It's time to reach the climax.

<color=#ffd34c>I hope you'll enjoy your time with us. Today, we're playing for you, Boss.</color>]]
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_YOO_JIN_RECITAL"
L32_1 = [[
She came from a dog-eat-dog world.
She's rough around the edges, including her hands that play music.
So, what did I teach her?
Not much. Music is about expressing who you are, isn't it?

<color=#ffd34c>You want me to look more serious. Well... If that's what you want, Boss, I'll try.</color>]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
L31_1 = {}
L32_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_CA_ADMIN_LEE_SUYEON_RECITAL"
L33_1 = [[
Like the aces of the sky that calm the discord on the battlefield,
we sing about order and passion this world filled with chaos.
We'd like to dedicate this song to you.
Are you ready?

<color=#ffd34c>Please have a seat. We'll present you with the greatest show you've ever seen.</color>]]
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
L32_1 = {}
L33_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_M_RAS_TOWER_RECITAL"
L34_1 = [[
For a long time, I dreamed in a soundless void.
I was woken up by the music that a robot played.
His instrument was shabby, but his music was anything but.
I hope this sound will reach you like his did me.

<color=#ffd34c>Daddy, can you hear this? It's the prettiest heartbeats I've made for you, Daddy!</color>]]
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
