I'm sure you were surprised that this wasn't a mail regarding business.
This is actually a message to congratulate you on your birthday.
Even though everyone was busy, they all made time to celebrate your birthday,
and it made me happy to see how the company's atmosphere also brightened up.
After all, today's a special day that only comes once a year, right?
I hope you have the most wonderful and happiest day today.]]
