L24_1 = [[
Tension has risen in the casino.
A bunny girl is effectively making customers part with their money.
Her poker face and cold taunts even attract bystanders and keep them enticed until they're completely broke.
Customers approach her table as if mesmerized by her proud smile.

<color=#ffd34c>You'd better try your best, human, if you don't want to become a backup body.</color>]]
