L25_1 = [[
A casino in the middle of the night.
She sits alone at a corner table in the bar to escape the loud music.
She keeps fidgeting with her clothes and pulling down her bunny ears as if to hide them.
I wore these for her...

<color=#ffd34c>If you're going to look, buy me a drink first. It's hard to put up with gazes like that in my right mind.</color>]]
