L7_1 = "Mm? Tuning? So, you were also interested in software. This may appear to be a simple array of 0s and 1s, but it's actually more fickle than a child. It requires tons of new data just to have its settings tweaked a little bit.\nBring me the datasets in that list, will you? I'll give this one a complete makeover for you.\n<color=#ffd34c>※ The Corrupted Wedge restores the HP of The Wall within range and grants it Damage/Debuff Immunity.</color>"
