L9_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SHARKS_C_CLAW"
L10_1 = "Dracasia is a striker who follows her target until the very end. If her target moves too far away from her, she uses an anchor like a grappling hook, instantly moving herself to it.\nOriginally,「Captain Drake」 was the moniker of a cunning C.O. that preyed on merchant vessels. The mercenaries of Front Bay always missed Captain Drake by a hair's breadth. When this little girl successfully brought it down, they gave her the nickname of her trophy.\nAs a TASKFORCE company, the Front Bay Sharks is still a rookie. Recently, it lost a precious ship in a dispute with a different company during the Bulwark Construction Festival.\nDracasia is confident that she can make up for such a small loss with her skills. Her confidence is the very reason the Front Bay Sharks always get in trouble."
