L45_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_HORIZON_6_EPILOGUE"
L46_1 = [[
The first day of existence in this world. The sun was rising above the horizon. The sunlight bleeding through the camera lens was exceedingly beautiful.
I wonder if she too wanted many people to go on seeing such beautiful light for one more day, again and again.]]
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_HORIZON_6_3"
L47_1 = [[
Please welcome her with a warm round of applause. Her name is Horizon. A heartless loan shark. Oh how she dragged her dead body along, staggering forward without friend nor family.
<color=#1DDB16>*[Horizon]: Passive abilities activated when HP is reduced to 50% or below.</color>
<color=#FF0000>*[Shena]: Constantly uses Perfect EVA buff.</color>
<color=#ffd34c>*[C.O. Suppressor]: Removes buffs from enemies within range.</color>
<color=#ffd34c>*[Secondary Frame]: Capable of forward deployment. Deals significant damage on ordinary monsters.</color>
<color=#ffd34c>*[Support Drone]: Restores HP of ally where summoned.</color>]]
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
