L23_1 = "The general consensus in the media is that the elusive CEO of Jehuty Biotech is deliberately trying to create a mysterious image. Recognized as the Entrepreneur of the Year in Charade, he has exerted significant efforts to improve the company image by promoting the medical relief program in marginalized areas."
