L24_1 = "Based on my investigation, it seems she mostly engaged in show of force using armored systems until she hired more staff. There was plenty of abandoned military gear to pick up after the war in the third world where she was active. She made a lot of enemies trying to collect debt from the warlords that had taken control of the area."
