L14_1 = "Tracks down the target to deal AoE damage with a sword before falling back. For targets beyond 600 reach, casts skill while ignoring the cooldown."
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
L13_1 = {}
L14_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JAPAN_C_OROCHI"
L15_1 = [[
Orochi is a ranger who focuses her attacks on a single target using her snake.
Long time ago, a great Famine hit the world. Then a woman who could hear every sound heard how lonely the Famine was, and soothed it to restore Fertility.
The woman served the Fertility for a long time, and people worshipped her as a priestess.
However, people became greedy and unsatisfied over time. They sought eternal life and eventually killed the priestess.
Fertility changed itself to an eight-headed snake which covered the rain, the thunder, and the mountains, and it punished humans until it was sealed at the cost of countless sacrifices.
But as long as human desire exists, Orochi will return, luring them with the promise of eternal life.]]
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
L14_1 = {}
L15_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JAPAN_S_KUNOICHI"
L16_1 = "Hayami Kanade is an irregular striker who enhances her stance by dodging attacks.\nBorn from a bodyguard family, she excelled in \"housework\" and eventually became the bodyguard of the Nanahara family leader.\nShe was a cold and rigid person at the beginning, but being with her gentle master gradually changed her. Besides protecting her master, she also obeyed her master’s orders to have a family and live a happy life.\nShe was not a Counter, but she took on important missions from the Administration and was rewarded with unique gear.\nBack then, no one knew this loyal and remarkable bodyguard would meet such a dishonorable end."
