L21_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ALPHA_CA_JIA"
L22_1 = "Singularity Shin Jia is a supporter who uses CRF particles to neutralize enemies and simultaneously grant buffs to allies.\nShe has limitless potential and the ability to manifest matter based on her imagination. Some speculate that this is the result of the human species reaching singularity. However, because she is inherently flawed, her humanity dwindles the more she uses her power, and there is a risk that she will become an inorganic being. Perhaps this is why her pursuit of humanity may have taken the form of imaginary wings. She is the most righteous result of one’s twisted fear, and she is still fighting for a better world today."
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
L21_1 = {}
L22_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ALPHA_C_SPEAR"
L23_1 = [[
Raphaela Juri the Evil Chaser is a hybrid-type attacker who can switch between tower "Watcher mode" and striker "Chaser mode."
Raphaela invented her own spearmanship in just one month after reading her twin brother Jun's secret note he left behind.
She is the only one who has mastered her "Tracking Spearmanship", which enables her to attack more powerfully as she battles more evil.
She joined Alphatrix because they appreciate her worth as the Chaser of Evil. Her activities are supported by the company.
* The above description is a summary of the resume submitted to Alphatrix by the subject of the investigation.]]
L21_1[1] = L22_1
L21_1[2] = L23_1
L22_1 = {}
L23_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_REAPER_M_SIEGE"
L24_1 = [[
Goliath is a slow siege that can shoot powerful munition and break enemy barriers.
Goliath is a military weapon created by the Northern Union, an entity that is exclusive and closed to outside interference.
It was built to intercept hostile ships on its own, and it proved its worth by shooting down in a single blow a pirate-commandeered Task Force Armored Ship as it crossed the Covenant's airspace.
Instead of simply obeying commands, the machine has a special A.I. algorithm known as loyalty.
However, it is unclear whether it works as intended by the designers.]]
L22_1[1] = L23_1
L22_1[2] = L24_1
L23_1 = {}
