L2_1 = "SI_PF_EVENT_MISSION_EP_ALPHA_TEXT"
L3_1 = [[
<color=#ffcf3b>Indisputable Evidence</color>,
 obtainable weekly through the Event episode,
can be exchanged for various items.]]
L1_1[1] = L2_1
L1_1[2] = L3_1
L2_1 = {}
L3_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ALPHA_C_CHESS"
L4_1 = [[
Gambler is a debilitating supporter who weakens her enemies with a chance to inflict greater weakening effects.
Gambler is infamous at the Underground Casino for doing whatever it takes to win a bet. Perhaps that is why many come to watch her play. People gather around curiously wanting to know how much she will bet or who she will eventually lose to.
Nobody knows who the Gambler is. Only rumors surround her because she appears to be wealthy and her presence at the casino occurred after the death of Alphatrix's President, with some even claiming she is a member of the Shin family who was pushed out during management disputes within Alphatrix.
According to reports, she recently obtained an alias, Cecilia Shin, and formed a paper company called Betatrix Company. What is not clear is her intentions with the company or who is funding her.
Nevertheless, there is no doubt that it is her opening move to win in her own gamble.]]
L2_1[1] = L3_1
L2_1[2] = L4_1
