L8_1 = "SI_UNIT_SKILL_DESC_REAPER_M_SIEGE_SKILL_LV1"
L9_1 = "Overloads the power and increases ATK by 30% (Up to 4 stacks). Does not cast skill if there is a Tower unit or Boss within 350 reach."
L7_1[1] = L8_1
L7_1[2] = L9_1
L8_1 = {}
L9_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SECURITY_S_AGENT"
L10_1 = "Revenant is a supporter that specializes in enhancing ally multi-unit Soldiers.\nHer real name is Leah Schneider. She is the best operative of the Gronia Department of National Security that handles Gronia’s domestic and international espionage activities. She performs well enough on her own, but she truly shines with her commanding ability that can elevate even a rookie squad to perform on par with an elite-level squad. Her track records are full of outstanding accomplishments such as foiling the plans of the internationally wanted Replacer Knight, and many deeds that cannot be disclosed to the public.\nShe loves bombastic hard rock and enjoys bike tours, which may lead one to believe her to be a free spirited individual, but higher-ups at the Department have commented that her hostility towards rebel forces has been exceedingly overt, even taking into account that the country is currently at war. "
L8_1[1] = L9_1
L8_1[2] = L10_1
L9_1 = {}
L10_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CORRUPTED_M_ARMOR"
L11_1 = [[
Mors is a defender that permanently increases her HP and DEF whenever an ally dies.
During the Old Administration days, Mors was an entity that encapsulated how dangerous a Shadow could be to normal units. Footage of her showed something ferocious and ominous. She is a C.O. that is as old as Maestra Nequitia is, but like any other Shadow, there is no way to know if one is truly able to communicate with her just because she is able to converse.
Notably, she is a rare object that displays hostility towards C.O.s, but one must be weary of her as her behavior patterns are not fully fleshed out, as can be seen from the troubles that arise when attempting communication with her. ]]
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
L10_1 = {}
L11_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HARMONY_CA_CONDUCT"
L12_1 = "Maestra Nequitia is a tower that grants increasingly crippling debuffs to enemies to support her members.\nMaestra is the Chief Conductor of the Elysium Philharmonic, and has enemies with the Old Administration. Old Administration divisions may have successfully intercepted her, but they have stopped tracking her due to the Administration Failure.\nMaestra’s world, called Elysion, was a world that possessed unnaturally sophisticated soundwave technology. The reason she posed such a threat to the Old Administration was because of the fact that she was the creator of Mental Printing, as well as her exclusive mastery of that unstable technique."
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
L11_1 = {}
L12_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HARMONY_C_BASS"
L13_1 = [[
Carmen is a supporter that heals her allies whenever she lands a CRIT. The notes that Carmen generates will remove harmful effects on her allies and heal their HP.
She is the representative member of contrabassists in the Elysium Philharmonic. Her calm and melancholic melodies grant power to Corrupted Objects and bring despair to her enemies.
From long ago, Carmen pursued coexistence with humans over bloodying her hands. However, her methods could not break free from the restraints she had as a shadow, and she had to go into hiding for a long time when her core was destroyed, and critically injured, during an encounter with the Old Administration.
When Carmen resurfaced, she was more adept at handling humans, and was seen as something that much more dangerous. Do not let her kind facade fool you.]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
