L2_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_3_INTERLUDE_3"
L3_1 = "A successful mission goes unnoticed."
L1_1[1] = L2_1
L1_1[2] = L3_1
L2_1 = {}
L3_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_3_INTERLUDE_4"
L4_1 = [[
Once, I dreamed I was a butterfly. Suddenly I woke up. I didn't know if it was me who had dreamt I was a butterfly, or a butterfly dreaming that it was I.
Between the butterfly and I there must be some distinction.]]
L2_1[1] = L3_1
L2_1[2] = L4_1
L3_1 = {}
L4_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_1"
L5_1 = "To avoid the sunlit land is instinctive. Those who revel in the dark have much reason to do so."
L3_1[1] = L4_1
L3_1[2] = L5_1
L4_1 = {}
L5_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_1_HM"
L6_1 = "War makes foes resemble one another."
L4_1[1] = L5_1
L4_1[2] = L6_1
L5_1 = {}
L6_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_2"
L7_1 = "According to a recent survey conducted by the TASKFORCE industry that asked, 「What’s the most harmful thing that came out of the Replacer Incident?」, many responded by saying 「Hybrider」. The march of progress is necessary, but can our industry remain honest if we were to turn a blind eye to indiscriminate use of it?"
L5_1[1] = L6_1
L5_1[2] = L7_1
L6_1 = {}
L7_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_INTERLUDE_1"
L8_1 = [[
...Let us think about this for a moment. An explosion happened in the middle of the capital. Many were sacrificed. But we could not pinpoint what caused it.
An attack from the rebels? Perhaps we wanted to believe it so at that time.]]
L6_1[1] = L7_1
L6_1[2] = L8_1
L7_1 = {}
L8_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_INTERLUDE_2"
L9_1 = "The Intelligence Chief added onto the interview. 「If I had to choose between the second best option and the second worst option, I would choose the second worst. Choosing something that is better than the worst is better for risk minimization than choosing something that is less than ideal.」 "
L7_1[1] = L8_1
L7_1[2] = L9_1
L8_1 = {}
L9_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_INTERLUDE_3"
L10_1 = "A certain phenomenon caused by Corruption rays is called the Counterside Effect. But this is from the perspective of the present world. From the Counterside, this is something inherent and natural to the world."
L8_1[1] = L9_1
L8_1[2] = L10_1
L9_1 = {}
L10_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_4_INTERLUDE_4"
L11_1 = "In silence she spoke. Music is the authority given to us. And in harmony, we shall find the hidden truth that shall lead us to meld with all there is to be.\n─ A line from a scripture found in the variable depth coordinates"
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
L10_1 = {}
L11_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_1"
L12_1 = "Tanaberin, soaked in Counterside Effect, does not experience sunset nor sunrise. The sky bleached white in day and night may look like an extraordinary natural phenomenon to people from other regions."
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
L11_1 = {}
L12_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_1_HM"
L13_1 = [[
It is said that when carrying out an execution, many people are each ordered to simultaneously press a single button. One of which will activate the device, and one of which will not do anything at all.
Sounds reasonable. Nobody wants blood on their hands.]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
L12_1 = {}
L13_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_2"
L14_1 = "War is not something that can be explained without discussing the insanity required to partake in it."
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
L13_1 = {}
L14_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_INTERLUDE_1"
L15_1 = "I think, therefore I am."
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
L14_1 = {}
L15_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_INTERLUDE_2"
L16_1 = [[
Some say the Old Administration is just a rumor. Some say they are a necessary evil. Some might even herald them as the bastion of mankind.
While others, detest them.]]
L14_1[1] = L15_1
L14_1[2] = L16_1
L15_1 = {}
L16_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CARNIVAL_5_INTERLUDE_3"
L17_1 = "To pass even a single agreement, many obstacles must be overcome. Some hope that their attempts to overcome those will be seen as a heartfelt struggle for peace to others."
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
