L19_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_SIXWING_AMY_FOOLSDAY"
L20_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nA big, evil conspiracy by a cabal to throw the world into chaos... \nIs the sort of thing I'm thinking about right now. \nI'm not feeling lazy or drowsy because it's spring. \nI'm trying to distract the wild beast from interfering with my scheme.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>How far did he go to get ice cream?</color>"
L18_1[1] = L19_1
L18_1[2] = L20_1
L19_1 = {}
L20_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_SIXWING_LEE_JISOO_FOOLSDAY"
L21_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nThe objective is to eliminate the target without a trace. \nAnd we the Six Wings don't tolerate failure.  \nI'd better take care of it before it's too late. \nMelted ice cream is a serious problem, you know. \n\n<color=#ffd34c>\"Buy Two, Get One Free?\" Then... would I lose money if I just buy one?</color>"
L19_1[1] = L20_1
L19_1[2] = L21_1
L20_1 = {}
L21_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_CHARLOTTE_FOOLSDAY"
L22_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nWe the Knights never ignore people's calls for help. \nEven after work hours. \nEven when we're too busy to even wipe sweat off our faces. \nStill, we find time to dress ourselves properly. \n\n<color=#ffd34c>A distress call? Got it. Let me just put this back on.</color>"
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
