L46_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_C_QUEEN"
L47_1 = "Jaina Kropel is a tenacious sniper with a self-healing ability; she can only charge her skill gauge through her basic attacks.\nJaina has been restrained in a supermax prison, and her existence has been highly classified.\nSince she lost all her memories, the Replacer Queen—her previous self—is nothing but a stranger to her. Whenever her old memories emerge from external stimuli, she gets nervous and tries to reject them. But it remains to be seen that the world will understand her current condition.\nOne thing is for certain; some people do consider her hidden memories as a very dangerous but useful weapon."
