L47_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_CA_JAKE"
L48_1 = "Colonel Jake Walker, equipped with Tech Level 5 gear Stormbringer, is a defender who specializes in weakening enemies within a certain range.\nColonel Walker’s CRF output is exceptional—to the point where maximizing the power can even hurt himself.\nHowever, the Stormbringer has put an end to such concerns. This high-tech gear accumulates Colonel Walker’s excessive power, and releases it in the form of a strong magnetic field. As Colonel Walker no longer has to restrain his powers, he’s now ready to go anywhere he’s needed."
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_C_QUEEN"
L49_1 = "A ranged attacker who constantly attacks while recovering her HP"
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "SI_UNIT_SKILL_DESC_DELTA_C_QUEEN_HYPER_LV1"
L50_1 = "Changes her weapon into a bow and shoots an arrow to inflict great damage on enemies in front. Increases Ultimate Skill DMG AMP based on the decreased HP (up to 50%), and restores HP by 2.5% per second for 5 seconds after the skill (Cannot be canceled)."
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_MILITIA_C_SCISSOR"
L51_1 = [[
Levia Thanis is an evasive defender who reacts to enemy's attack to defeat them.
A long time has passed since Nancy, a small-town hairdresser, disappeared. The elders, her regulars, would often make jokes about her fleeing town after locking eyes with a man, unaware that she had picked up a pale blue-glowing Watch on an unfortunate day.
Just as rumors of a plain-looking woman in an apron wandering among the mercenaries began to die down, a stunningly dressed hairdresser started roaming around the busy streets. She enjoys adorning herself and flaunting her fashion sense. Once you become her target, she does not let go, regardless of whether you are her prey or customer.
Speculation that Levia and Nancy are the same person is close to the truth. But the real question is who has control of the body. ]]
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
