L21_1 = "SI_DP_GAUNTLET_ASYNC_NEW_INFO_LEAGUE_DESC"
L22_1 = "· Battle against opponent’s Defense squad.\n· A Defense squad must be formed to participate in Strategy Battle.\n· Additional stats from gear, level-up, and enhancement will be partially applied.\n· Win a certain amount of Victory Points to move up to a higher league.\n· Winning multiple Strategy Battles in a row to get the consecutive win bonus.\n· In higher leagues, you can be demoted without warning if you fall below the necessary Victory Points.\n· Victory Points will be deducted for failing to defend, but will no longer be deducted after a certain amount.\n· You can earn Victory Points with NPC Battles up to a certain League.\n· You can have Revenge Battle against an opponent that beat your Defense Squad."
