L30_1 = "SI_PF_ASYNCMATCH_NEW_DESC"
L31_1 = [[
An asynchronous battle mode.
You can manually control your units to fight.

You will get rewards based on your performance at the end of each week and season.

Only <color=#ffdb6c>10% of HP, ATK, and DEF increased by gear and growth applies.
Basic Deployment Resource cost does not increase as per ship grade.
20% Max DMG Taken Limit added to SSR ships.</color>]]
