L38_1 = "In Strategy Battle, you can <COLOR=#FFBC00>enjoy asynchronous battles</COLOR>.\nHere, you will fight <COLOR=#FFBC00>the opponent’s Defense squad</COLOR>.\nIf you win, you obtain Victory Points; if you lose, you lose Victory Points."
