L39_1 = [[
To start Strategy Battle, you first have to <COLOR=#FFBC00>form a Defense squad</COLOR>.
Your Defense squad will fend off attacks from other companies, and be affected by buffs and Bans & Ups.
You will get <COLOR=#FFBC00>Gauntlet Points</COLOR> if you successfully defend.
Victory Points will be deducted for failing a Defensive Battle, but will no longer be deducted after a certain amount]]
