L5_1 = "Britra will <COLOR=#FFBC00>gain a barrier and start gathering power 1 minute and 20 seconds before the battle ends.</COLOR>\nWhile Britra <COLOR=#FFBC00>gathers power, focus fire on Britra to stop it.</COLOR>\nIf failed to stop, Britra will deal massive damage to your ship and employees.\nIf stopped, Britra will be Stunned for a moment and you may deal massive damage by focusing fire.\n※ Britra will only do this <COLOR=#FFBC00>when it is below 85% of its max HP.</COLOR>\n※ Britra will create a barrier that scales with HP depending on its level."
