L51_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_OZ_M_PUPPET"
L52_1 = "Skia Crow is a ranger who assists allies with enemy debuffs and strengthens herself with continuous attacks.\nShe had become a vegetable as a result of an unfortunate accident. However, with the assistance of the AI 「Nic. Chopper 001」 , a brain support device, she is able to hug her friends as she always has.\nHer emotional expressions are rather awkward due to her movements being solely based on memory. Still, none of this matters because her friends can tell what she is thinking by looking at the emojis on her forehead display.\nBut they have to see if those emotions are really hers or not."
