L2_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_OZ_C_SWORD"
L3_1 = "Liona is a melee AoE attack-type striker who deals increased DMG to Units with low HP. The wielder does not move on their accord, but passively follows the parasite’s will and attacks enemies.\n A scaredy-cat girl, who used to look up to Counters, bonds with a parasite called 「Shard of the Devil」 during an unfortunate accident and becomes a Counter herself. However, the reality of being a Counter was much different from what she had dreamed of. Is this because of the parasite?\n Despite this, she has named the parasite 「Toto」 and fed him good food in an effort to understand him. Now, she considers it a blessing that she can protect her friends using Toto’s power."
L1_1[1] = L2_1
L1_1[2] = L3_1
L2_1 = {}
L3_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_OZ_S_RUNNER"
L4_1 = "Dorothy is a support-type sniper that neutralizes enemies and buffs allies. She deals ranged DMG by using her prosthesis to move at extremely high speeds.\n Her dream was to be a professional track athlete until she lost that dream after an unfortunate accident. The prosthesis nicknamed 「Slippers」 became her new legs. \n The experimental mechanical device grants extreme movement speed and jumping power, but can be as difficult to control as a mustang. Her desire to run again may have become the reins that she uses to control Slippers.\n On the other hand, very few organizations that can handle such technologies, raising questions about the organization that provided Slippers to her."
L2_1[1] = L3_1
