L11_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_VATICAN_C_BOOK"
L12_1 = [[
Biblide is a ranger who excels at basic attacks, being able to completely control paper.
A former member of the Miracle Investigation Council, she applied to become a librarian at the Holy Curia for reasons unknown. However, the librarians working there are convinced that her obsession with reading has to do with her finding the right book to use as a catalyst.
The Holy Curia library, where she was in charge of old books, highly regarded her vast knowledge and ability to turn old paper into new.
Even during her Investigation Council days, her strict and cold personality was well known, making it difficult for others to be around her. However, she also does not turn away those who want to learn and donates picture books to orphanages as well as teaches those who are unable to attend school due to family circumstances.
Following the recent incident at the Holy Curia, intel indicates that she has rejoined the Investigation Council, effectively ending her retirement.]]
