L48_1 = "In a time of coexistence, a shaman worshipped a snake.\nTired of human greed, the snake turned its back on humans.\nThe shaman's lineage, on the other hand, stood by humans and fought against the vengeance of the snake.\nWhat would have happened if the shaman's descendants had stayed by the snake until the end? \n\n<color=#ffd34c>Come. The snake’s voice calls upon thee.</color>"
