L50_1 = "What if... there was another person just like our Commander?\nSo, you know how they say there's something on the other side of the world that looks exactly like you?\nAnd most of the time, we don’t know what our Commander is thinking\nMaybe you’re right... Just because they look alike doesn’t mean they’ll suddenly click.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>It's fine. We don't do what we do for the sake of others' understanding, do we?</color>"
