L33_1 = "There exists a legend at Counter Academy.\nIt is a story about the mysterious and beautiful girl from Student Guide.\nThe countless inappropriate books seized by her are said to have become a fantastic collection of hers.\nThough rumors circulate that the majority of these books feature a crown prince as the protagonist, this has never been proven. \n\n<color=#ffd34c>I’m merely exploring the culture of aliens. There is no ulterior motive. None. Never. Absolutely not.</color>"
