L12_1 = [[
With the final battle that the world's fate hinges on drawing near, Joo Shiyoung temporarily put her motto, of "I do as much as I'm paid for," to rest and officially joined Delta Seven.
The suit assigned to her was crafted with the technology of a fallen world, and it grants short-distance jump abilities to space manipulators. Through this suit, Shiyoung has mastered the skill of breaking through enemy lines on the battlefield and reflecting enemy attacks with minimum movement.
She did not reveal her true intentions, but as a freelance mercenary, she might have chosen to risk her life and fight back because she wanted to watch her friend's back rather than because she wanted to save the world.]]
