L35_1 = [[
As Police SWAT 4 has made some notable achievements, even those lukewarm leaders are beginning to show enthusiasm in supporting the team.
Now police helicopters are also dispatched to control traffic and pursue suspects, contributing to a faster arrest. The new latest-spec police cars are ready to help you make the best of your driving skills on any road. Of course, just a sturdy personal gear would be enough for Lieutenant Kang, who has demonstrated excellent performance even in poor conditions.]]
