L35_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ORCA_RA"
L36_1 = [[
Orca, the ominously gleaming red Watch, always simmers with hatred toward Corrupted Objects.
Its overflowing hatred would have been disastrous should it not have been given a new shape and purpose by its current owner. Its predatory spirit stays undetected under the shadows like the toothed whale would under the surface of the waters, until its owner is ready to pounce on her enemies. For now, it's only dangerous to Corrupted Objects because of its silent, yet strong bond with its owner.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_YOO_MI_NA_RA"
L37_1 = "Yoo Mina carries out missions as boldly as before, but now with more professionalism and efficiency, based on her experience at the Coffin Company. Her Unique Gear, Wolvesbane, has finally broken its silence and started accepting her power. She still needs certain special gear to use it to its fullest potential, but its resistance to her control has definitely weakened."
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_CIVIL_IRIE_RA"
L38_1 = "Irie was looking for new prank materials when she came up with a brilliant idea. She balled up her CRF, which made her body as light and flexible as a rubber ball, and it turned into an awesome shield. This highly elastic shield can bounce off oncoming enemies and be stretched wide to protect allies. Irie can't wait to play pranks with this remarkable invention of hers."
L36_1[1] = L37_1
L36_1[2] = L38_1
L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_XIAOLIN_RB"
L39_1 = "The researchers have decided that Xiao Lin is the right person to help them test-drive Falcon Nest, a drone carrier in the technical verification stage. This drone carrier designed for base protection purposes uses swift small drones to clear enemies in the rear. The researchers expect Xiao Lin and Falcon Nest to show remarkable performance in taking the upper hand in battle together."
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_XIAOLIN_RA"
L40_1 = "Xiao Lin has further improved her bioelectricity-controlling ability, which she previously used for precise shooting. Her 4 support drones, which she controls through electric current, volley-fire at her target, eliminating even the slimmest possibility of survival. Door Knocker, having been intensified by the mutual interference between her and her support drones, now makes a good siege method to resolve a stalemate on the battlefield."
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
L39_1 = {}
L40_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_BD_ELIZABETH_RA"
L41_1 = [[
  The daughter of a proud noble family. Everything else about Elizabeth is not public knowledge. But since she's also the Chief of Prydwen, the general consensus is that she isn't just a sheltered flower. 
 Those who saw her swords pouring down from the sky thought an angel of wrath descended upon them with her steel wings stretched to the sides. The wings on her back are believed to be simple traces of her CRF, only revealed when she wields her true power, but the truth is yet to be known.]]
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
L40_1 = {}
L41_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_STREGA_LAURA_RA"
L42_1 = "  It's time the sleeping witch wakes up. As the lid on her coffin slides open, a horde of silently screaming ghosts pours out. The witch calls her familiar, sleepily rubbing her eyes. Her familiar, instead of herding the unruly ghosts and responding to his witch, like the loyal servant he is, runs around with them, causing trouble. If the witch knew how mischievous her familiar and ghosts were, she would never have let them sleep with her."
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
L41_1 = {}
L42_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_YOO_JIN_RB"
L43_1 = [[
Eujin, having encountered formidable enemies one after another, realized her impulsive, uncoordinated fighting style didn't work anymore.
And her frustration awakened part of her animalistic nature that her old researchers failed to educe artificially. Believed to be of a Bygone, her new power heightens her sense of smell, helping her detect her enemies' weaknesses, while warping the law of physics in a limited area.
Now, Eujin can handle stubborn enemies with practiced ease and bullets that follow their targets like dogged hounds.]]
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_HB_MIYA_RA"
L44_1 = [[
Miya has discovered her potential as a great entertainer while broadcasting for HRT Berry. She proved this by wearing the bold show outfit with aplomb that Lumi picked for her for their shopping tour segment.
Her old fans still make fun of her every time Miya makes a mistake, commenting how helplessly shy she is or how Mi-Whale hasn't grown as they make donations to her. At the same time, they enthusiastically encourage her when she pulls herself together and continues with her show. Perhaps teasing is just their way of adoring their idol.]]
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_DELTA_SYLVIA_RB"
L45_1 = [[
With technological advancements, it has become common for freelance hackers and crackers to be quick on their feet. For if they sit in front of a computer for hours on end, a bullet could be aimed directly at them within minutes.
The same rule applies for Sylvia as well.
Although she may have unlimited resources such as trained elite soldiers and military funding for assisting the Delta Seven operations, the same cannot be said for working secretly and alone. Here, she must don her hood and vanish into the neon lights.
And of course, those who fail to track her down will have to watch their fortress crumble.]]
L43_1[1] = L44_1
L43_1[2] = L45_1
L44_1 = {}
L45_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_C_DELTA_SYLVIA_RB"
L46_1 = "A supporter who keeps Tower units in check and neutralizes the enemy by weakening their ATK"
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_YG_SORIM_RA"
L47_1 = "Every year, the Administration Counter Academy hosts a festival where outsiders are welcome to visit. To increase public awareness of Counters, flashy performances by students using their abilities are held during the festival.\nThis year’s notable performance is 「Descend! Animal Rescue Specialists!」. Please look forward to the gunpowdery performances of the veteran agent 「Trigger of Judgment」 and the tough 「Sergeant Smith」.\nThe main performance of the rabbit members was gladly supported by students with telekinetic abilities. They seemed to have been touched by the scene where Sergeant Smith falls in battle while doing a handstand. "
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
L46_1 = {}
L47_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_M_FUTURE_TITAN_RA"
L48_1 = "An anti-C.O. combat Mech with high area suppression capabilities."
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FUTURE_TITAN_RA"
L49_1 = "Young scientists consider the Future-at-War project to be the ideal of academia. However, given that the ongoing war, the conflicting interests of invested nations, and the differing backgrounds and origins of the involved personnel, it’s not easy for the researchers to focus entirely on the research.\nThe Jupiter files were propositions that were abandoned by the Future at War researchers because of many real-world limitations tied to it. Three of those were drafted to enhance the power of unmanned main weapons.\nThe Triaina Plan is an improvement that plans to bring the Titan’s performance closer to that of the original. The enhanced compound armor and the canister anti-air gun allows it to adapt to various situations, and a slew of active defense systems await any enemy that can break through the brutal bombardment. Sergei Chernov, a researcher who was part of the plans, noted as such.\n─「For a future where our children will be strangers to war.」"
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_C_CIVIL_IRIE_RA"
L50_1 = "Taunts and uses AoE suppression skills on the front lines, protecting allies."
