L4_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_HB_GAEUN_RA"
L5_1 = [[
Gaeun may have started broadcasting to meet someone special. Nonetheless, Gaeun of HRT Berry has gradually revealed her leadership abilities through her broadcasting.
She developed the charisma to encompass her members' strong personalities, such as Lumi's overflowing confidence, Bomi's laid-back demeanor, and Miya's seasoned broadcasting experience.
Even when she is not in the center, Gaeun's leadership brings out the best in each member, both on air and on stage.
As a result, major entertainment companies have recognized HRT Berry as a rising idol group.
Gaeun is now in the spotlight and can smile brightly at her fans, despite the fact that she is still not as good as the other members at dancing and singing.
Because she now understands that her biggest fan, Teacher, is always somewhere rooting for her.]]
