L7_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_SCHOOL_CHAIR_RA"
L8_1 = "The inventions that young Edith created as a hobby caused a stir in the scientific community. Future-at-War attempted to recruit her as the lead robot engineer but she wasn't interested in the role. After a one-sided compromise, she is currently in the Counter Academy instead of the research center, while Future-at-War provides her with financial support for her hobbies. In the end, society considers her a member of Future-at-War anyways."
