L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_RAS_MA_DINO"
L33_1 = [[
The heart-seeing Shepherd and the massive heavy weapon Lurcher always move together. Thanks to both being together, Lurcher is able to distinguish friend from foe on the battlefield.
At first glance, it appears that Lurcher is dragging Shepherd along with him. And this is true.
However, the two are in an interdependent relationship, with neither giving orders to the other. Shepherd calms the aggressive Lurcher so he doesn't get out of line, and Lurcher wants to help the kindhearted Shepherd. However, because Lurcher prioritizes instinct over reason, it is sometimes more important to retrieve the stick she throws.]]
