L29_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CLB001_2_3_CM"
L30_1 = [[
This is going to be a spectacular show.
<color=#ffd34c>

* [I-NO]: I-NO's Ultimate Skill inflicts near-death damage on all units on the battlefield, Ground and Air alike.
Her performance becomes more ruthless every time someone in the audience swoons. Don't let them listen to her play for too long.</color>]]
