L35_1 = "Through hard training mode, you can get large sums of resources you need to enter battle."
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_CLB001_2_1_CM"
L36_1 = [[
It's for those who want to conquer a high-level stage. Honor is the only reward.
<color=#ffd34c>* If you have 5 units or more on the battlefield, it will be considered cheating and the enemy will immediately use an Ultimate Skill.

* [Millia Rage]: Attacks and casts Psych Burst, pushing surrounding enemies and increasing her ATK and ASPD.
* [Ramlethal Valentine]: Gatling Combo's last attack casts a debuff and stacks a noncancellable buff on her. The buffs are fully canceled every time she's defeated.</color>]]
