L46_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CHARADE_C_CRIMSON"
L47_1 = [[
Ozymandias is a striker specializing in destroying enemy lines by stunning enemies upon deployment and pulling far-away enemies toward her.
She is the champion of Charade's Gauntlet League. As the undefeated Grade S Counter champion, she sets the annual record for the most points awarded to a single player every year.
Ozymandias represents Charade, a place where the Administration's control is relatively weak. Moreover, based on the fact that she continues to live a lavish, debaucherous lifestyle while the paparazzi turn a blind eye, one can speculate how close she is to her colossal sponsors.]]
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
L46_1 = {}
L47_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ALPHA_C_CHOWON_PR"
L48_1 = [[
Kim Chowon is a defender who specializes in suppressing multiple enemies, hindering their advance by planting explosives.
Explosives are a trustworthy ally that Underground mercenaries who operate outside the law carry with them wherever they go. They are especially suited to situations where it is difficult to eliminate C.O.s with personal firearms or when blasting thick walls.
That is why nothing is more terrifying than explosives in the hands of the enemy. Even more so if that enemy is a spider who hides in her web and hangs her prey.
War leaves many people devastated. But for some, unfortunately, it is a place where they discover their bloodthirsty desires.]]
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
