L51_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_REPLACER_C_KNIGHT_AP"
L52_1 = "Rebecca Catherine is a ranged striker that inflicts massive damage on Mech units by using magnetic force.\nShe is a visitor from another world and the vanguard of 「Delta Seven: Pathfinder」.\nHaving been a test subject for an unofficial Counter training project, she barely survived on her own after the research center closed down. Although her Counter abilities are not outstanding, she has good combat sense, pulling off stylish attacks with her magnetic force-amplifying baseball bat to gather or release scrap metal.\nShe shows great passion for baseball, and claims that the best team in her original world was the Giants. However, there is no way to confirm if any of this is true or not."
