L4_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_CA_KYLE_AP"
L5_1 = "Minerva Karin Wong is a ranger who uses a laser to penetrate enemies and deal damage as well as an enhanced bulwark to repel enemy attacks.\nShe is the commander of 「Delta Seven: Pathfinder」and the last remaining member of Delta Seven in this wounded world.\nKarin has a Unique Gear called Glaukopis implanted in her right eye, which originates from a world that has already collapsed. This gear maximizes her analytical abilities and grants her a direct connection to the Lost Ship known as Aegis. Thus, she is able to freely control the ship without assistance, summon state-of-the-art gear from Aegis's arsenal that is appropriate for each battle situation, and utilize it to its fullest extent.\nThe girl once lost her comrades and collapsed at a crossroads, but now has the power to follow the will of the destroyed world and forge her own path."
