L37_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SCHOOL_C_STAFF"
L38_1 = [[
Ciel is an assassin and a striker who attacks the backlines by swinging her spear, Bakuya, and deflecting the enemies' attacks.
Despite her aspirations to become a model student, she is a nocturnal girl who is rarely awake in class. She had no social skills when she first entered the Academy; she did not even know what the word "friend" meant. Now, however, she is slowly learning about daily life with the aid of her fellow students.
She is the leader of an assassin sect that rules a city and makes no attempt to conceal this fact. Some students took it seriously at first. But, given her innocence and inability to refuse any favor, no one believes she is a true assassin.
Do not be alarmed if you notice Ciel looking irritated during the day. She's simply trying to get a better view of the object in front of her.]]
