L48_1 = [[
Warden is a sniper who uses shield tactics to boost his survivability while dealing massive damage.
Nordnavik formed this sniper squad to defend their perimeters against large C.O.s.
Used along side the lightweight pavise, the mysterious gun known as Bronze Branch is a replica of a specific Artifact that deals effective damage to even high-grade C.O.s.
The squad primarily employs volley fire tactics, focusing on the targets' weak points.]]
