L49_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_GAMECIRCLE_C_VIOLET"
L50_1 = "The enemy’s skill... I interrupt. And... keep check of all enemies... I am a sniper. \nThe second companion to join Mi Rinae’s conquest of finding the Master Sword. Bora is available to play after clearing Counters Saga once.\nWhile often being seen as an oddball because of her slow and peculiar tone of speech, Bora’s senses exceed far beyond others due to her ability to control radio waves. She supports her friends with this ability, using a guitar that she tuned herself.\nShe normally looks indifferent to others. But she considers Mi Rinae a rival and never avoids a battle against her! \n* Excerpted from the guidebook of <Counters Saga>."
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
