L50_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_CA_FROZEN"
L51_1 = [[
Tenured President Regina MacCready is a ranger who can freeze her enemy and deal lethal blows with her permanently increased ATK.
ESPR is a powerful conspiratorial organization that has grown over time. Their obsession with the Lake has earned them many enemies, but they have persevered all these years by hiding behind various aliases.
Now, the Society is announcing a new leader and a new era. The storm that will bring about change may be biting and painful, but it will be unavoidable in the end.]]
