L3_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JUNIOR_C_RULER"
L4_1 = "Sky Layfield is a supporter who strengthens the allies and weakens the enemy. She is a Counter from the Academy's elementary section. She's been alone for a long time, so she's used to playing with a ball by herself or playing with her imaginary friend. Even after she became a Counter and entered the Academy, she carried on the same way of life for a while. However, ever since she joined the Special Hero Class, everything has changed. She has made many friends and is now receiving a hero training from the club leader to protect them. Her ball and her imaginary friend have now become weapons to protect her real friends. Will she be able to make even more friends?"
L2_1[1] = L3_1
L2_1[2] = L4_1
L3_1 = {}
L4_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_RAS_MA_TOWER"
L5_1 = [[
Sigma is a striker who shoots awesome lasers and punches enemies really hard!
Hi! I'm Sigma! I'm supposed to write my intro here, right? Sigma is Daddy's awesome little girl! And since I can use my full power now, I'm Daddy's super powerful girl!
The Terrabrains have no power limits because we are built to handle a lot of work! That means if I have all the power in the world, I can become as strong as I want!
That's because earlier models were made without considering power limits...? Oops! Sorry about that! I just looked through my manual for a sec. Anyway! Sigma is the strongest of all Terrabrains! That's the end of my introduction! I'm off to play with Daddy now!]]
L3_1[1] = L4_1
L3_1[2] = L5_1
L4_1 = {}
L5_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_ESPR_PILE"
L6_1 = [[
Rivet is a ranged attacker using a massive support weapon. A veteran soldier who has survived many different battlefields, she's capable of handling Corrupted Objects and even Counters.

In the Underground, all kinds of people can be found, from able fighters who have a personal reason to hide their identities to freaks that live in their own worlds. Rivet is an outlaw encompassing both sides.
As if to prove her claim that she became a mercenary just for the thrill of it, she was mainly seen in the depths of the Counterside or intensely disputed territories. If there was no trouble, she created it on her own, and because of this, she was known as the most dangerous person to associate with among newcomers of the Underground. When she disappeared and didn't show up for a long time, people thought she got herself killed.
Lately, however, it's been confirmed that she's just joined the Society. Whatever her reason was to join, it can't have been a sound one, given her track record for reckless and dangerous behavior.]]
L4_1[1] = L5_1
L4_1[2] = L6_1
L5_1 = {}
L6_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HORIZON_C_STAND"
L7_1 = "Rita Arsenico is a supporter summoning Omertà to repel enemies. Her ability to control metal is especially threatening to Mech units.\n\n She wouldn't admit to this, but she's a main contributor to Horizon Finance's ruthless reputation among its customers, who can't help but cooperate in the face of her glaring eyes and intimidating tone of voice. According to a bartender at her favorite bar, Rita's customers range from heinous criminals to lawyers, a curious combination that hints at an interesting past."
L5_1[1] = L6_1
L5_1[2] = L7_1
L6_1 = {}
L7_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_NKM_UNIT_BORDER_S_HUNTER"
L8_1 = "Ranged attackers that knockback enemies with enhanced attacks"
L6_1[1] = L7_1
L6_1[2] = L8_1
L7_1 = {}
L8_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JAPAN_CA_SENHIME"
L9_1 = [[
Orochinagi Nanahara Chifuyu is a striker who weakens enemies and becomes stronger as she takes damage. 
The Nanahara style is a style of swordsmanship that roots in the swordsmanship of the Nether God, a master of the blade. The ancestors of the Family Alliance worked hard for a very long time to perfect their swordsmanship, however, failed to do so. It seemed impossible for a mere human to become the legendary being who is not only fast and powerful, but also unafraid of death. The Nanahara ancestors believed that completing the Sacred Treasure called "Orochinagi" would be the answer. 
Having finally obtained Orochinagi after a series of challenges, she now cuts through the destined apocalypse and moves on.]]
L7_1[1] = L8_1
L7_1[2] = L9_1
L8_1 = {}
L9_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_FENRIR_C_INTERN"
L10_1 = [[
Noelle is a sniper manipulating projectiles that penetrate enemies to make variables.
She is the newest member of Fenrir Squad and fights enemies with the vajra, which can move freely in the air. Her superior has rated Noelle at -2 while rating her vajra at 12 on the usefulness scale.
Noelle became a fan of Fenrir Squad after watching their videos on NetTube, and her love for the squad is unmatched. She spends most of her money on discontinued Fenrir Squad merchandise. She has a habit of wasting money, so special supervision from her superiors is required.]]
L8_1[1] = L9_1
L8_1[2] = L10_1
L9_1 = {}
L10_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HARMONY_C_TRUMPET"
L11_1 = "Luna is a flying defender who absorbs allies' damage and creates barriers.\nIn Elysium Philharmonic, she is in charge of brass instruments. She was only there as a temporary member at first, but the conductor quickly recognized her due to her unexpected performance abilities.\nEven though she is the weakest Shadow of all due to her unusually high death rate, she is still an Elite Member due to her strong determination to keep that seat and to survive.\nShe will gladly bend her knee for even a human if it means being able to survive. Her love of food is also an indication of how Shadows are always obsessed with something.\nThis could also explain some of her hesitancy to resent humans so easily. "
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
L10_1 = {}
L11_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_DREAM_C_NIGHTMARE"
L12_1 = [[
Lulu the Nightmare is a supporter who removes enemies' buffs, and puts multiple units to sleep.
The one who saves the trembling owners of the dream from their nightmares is none other than this little girl. Lulu enters people's nightmares every night and collects them.
Originally being a nightmare herself, she helps the dreamers sleep soundly by removing rather than amplifying their nightmares, believing that it is repentance rather than courtesy. Despite the fact that her long isolation has made her naive about the world, she still shows compassion to those around her.
She, on the other hand, questions her existence because she lost consciousness at the same time as the being who sacrificed countless human beings awoke.]]
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
L11_1 = {}
L12_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_GEASS_C_LELOUCH_RA"
L13_1 = [[
Lelouch Lamperouge is a supporter who grants allies Skill Haste while inflicting enemies with Seal Skill.
Lelouch, the Eleventh Prince of the Holy Britannian Empire, conceals his true identity and goes by the alias Zero in order to incite a rebellion against his country and exact revenge.
His supernatural ability, Geass, guarantees absolute obedience from anyone. He starts a war against his own country using his Geass and his Order of the Black Knights, which can hold their own against Britannia.
He has won numerous victories with his brilliant strategy, excellent commanding ability, and quick thinking in order to create a world in which his sister, Nunnally, could live in peace.]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
L12_1 = {}
L13_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_MILITIA_YURI"
L14_1 = "Lee Yuri is a ranger inflicting lethal damage on Counters. She's also a member of the Militia that hunts down Counter criminals. She suffers from amnesia from the shock of witnessing her family's massacre. She joined the seedy, dark side of society to find the owner of the voice that she hears in her nightmares. She's bolder and more adaptive than any other recruit, and has survived many battles, but still is not used to watching people die. Every day, she reminds herself why she chose this path: revenge."
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
L13_1 = {}
L14_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_EXPRESS_C_LALA"
L15_1 = [[
Lara Jaeger is a tower that rotates around a selected spot in Perfect EVA mode, attacking enemies within range.
Platina Express only awards the best employee with the Platinum rank, and Lara hasn't lost her Platinum rank since she joined the company.
Just like every other delivery person, she aims for accurate, safe, on-time delivery. She also loves to see happy smiles on her customers as they receive their packages.
Even though she's never fought professionally, no one has ever dared try to steal from her while she's en route to deliver her packages.]]
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
L14_1 = {}
L15_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CANARY_S_ASSAULT"
L16_1 = "Laika is a ranger that buffs her own attacks and has great synergy with Félicette.\nRats and cockroaches aren't the only critters residing in Charade's sewers and back alleys. Laika was also one of those derelicts who went underground to avoid society. If she had not met Félicette, she would still be lurking in the dark and humid depths.\nShe often presents herself as a rough and reckless person, but the occasional sharp sense she lets out proves that she has not given up on life, unlike the other derelicts."
L14_1[1] = L15_1
L14_1[2] = L16_1
L15_1 = {}
L16_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ADMIN_CA_ARTILLERY"
L17_1 = [[
Kresnik Lyudmila is a supporter who is proficient in interrupting the enemy's skill casting.
She is a Shadow who went through special modification through the Artifact, and the first official C.O.  that banded together with mankind. Like her true identity, her combat suit exterior is also a type of armored-skin that set in through Corruption ray.
As she was reborn to be a Demogorgon-type Shadow, her existing alternate dimension was expanded in both size and utility. This alternate dimension functions as a separate world that possesses its own unique properties and is deadly to opponents.
The name "Kresnik" comes from the tale of vampire hunters with the same name. It is said that they were born the same as vampires but a minuscule difference makes them the rivals to vampires. That is Lyudmila's wish, as well as the wish of those who have faith in her.]]
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
L16_1 = {}
L17_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_MILITIA_SEONGTAE"
L18_1 = "Kang Minwoo is a defender who decreases Counter damage on ally Soldiers. He's also the leader of the Militia that hunts down Counter criminals. He became a criminal himself out of spite for society, in which Counters are given endless advantages. He's notorious for his ruthlessness in eliminating his targets, but some civilians show unwavering faith in him, calling him their representative against Counter crimes. It's true that the Militia has never attacked unarmed civilians, but that doesn't change its radical nature or the dangerousness of its leader."
L16_1[1] = L17_1
L16_1[2] = L18_1
L17_1 = {}
L18_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_GEASS_MA_SEITEN"
L19_1 = "Kallen Kozuki is a striker who uses her Knightmare, GUREN TYPE-08 ELEMENTS \"SEITEN\", and its Radiant Wave to weaken the enemy's survivability.\nShe is of British-Japanese descent, but she identifies as Japanese and goes by the name Kallen Kozuki.\nKallen met Zero while serving in a resistance group for Japan's independence. She was recognized for her exceptional abilities, and as a result, she became the Order of the Black Knights' ace pilot.\nGUREN TYPE-08 ELEMENTS \"SEITEN\" is a 9th generation Knightmare frame. After Guren Flight-Enabled Version was captured, Britannian scientists Lloyd and Cécile converted it into GUREN TYPE-08 ELEMENTS \"SEITEN\" with specifications that made it nearly impossible for ordinary people to operate.\nIts right arm fires various types of Radiant Waves with its heavily upgraded Armor Piercing Bombardment-type Radiation Wave Unit. Its Energy Wing System, which can both attack and defend, enables GUREN TYPE-08 ELEMENTS \"SEITEN\" to dominate the battlefield."
L17_1[1] = L18_1
L17_1[2] = L19_1
L18_1 = {}
L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JUNIOR_C_POLEARM"
L20_1 = "Kaci Bins is a defender who grows stronger, the more she attacks enemies. She is an elementary student at the Academy who loves plants. She has a Counter phobia although she herself is a Counter, so she has few friends despite her kind and caring personality. She loves flower arranging so much that she started a club at school, and she has extensive knowledge of plants. However, her Counter abilities are mostly based on her instincts, not on learning. Even so, Kaci always ranks at the top of the Academy by pure strength, so the Special Hero Class is always keeping an eye on her."
L18_1[1] = L19_1
L18_1[2] = L20_1
L19_1 = {}
L20_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CA_JOO_SHI_YOON"
L21_1 = [[
Joo Shiyoon has cut off the old chains of anguish and completed himself. A striker specializing in countering enemies' Basic and Special Skill attacks, he's armed with the Dragon Fang and Yeonhwa, the sword-and-sheath pair that's been handed down among the Truth Seeker bloodline.
He's always been an unreadable enigma to those around him. Even he himself didn't know what he wanted.
He had scores to settle, but he was reluctant. He wanted to forgive his enemy, but he couldn't find a reason to.
Then, he was forced to face his dilemma at the border between life and death, and his aimless wandering was over. He was freed from the old pain that had tormented him for a long time. He's found enlightenment.
Now, he no longer hesitates to draw the sword that he received from his mother. Nor quietly excuses himself from the battle scene without the others knowing. Instead, he now fights at the front lines, protecting his friends at the most critical moment.
But of course, he claims that nothing about him has changed.]]
L19_1[1] = L20_1
L19_1[2] = L21_1
L20_1 = {}
L21_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_C_JAPAN_SETSUNA"
L22_1 = "Increases surrounding allies' DEF and enhances melee units."
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
L21_1 = {}
L22_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_GAMECIRCLE_C_STAR"
L23_1 = [[
Hi-yap! Mi Rinae is a striker who can switch out weapons for different effects!
She's the carefree high school student who's also the main character of the game! One day, she somehow awakened as a Counter! She can freely use all three of her weapons, a fire-breathing Flame Sword, a bone-chilling Blizzard Axe, and a lightning summoning Storm Hammer, in her journey to find the Master Sword which Starlight blesses...!
She can be a bit clumsy sometimes, but her heart is in the right place. She cares for her friends and her teacher, and has a passion driven to achieve her dreams!
* Excerpted from the guidebook of <Counters Saga>.]]
L21_1[1] = L22_1
L21_1[2] = L23_1
L22_1 = {}
L23_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_BARCODE_C_CHILDREN"
L24_1 = "High-efficiency melee attackers who grow stronger when they're together."
L22_1[1] = L23_1
L22_1[2] = L24_1
L23_1 = {}
L24_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BAR_C_CEO"
L25_1 = [[
Gremory is a supporter that spreads lovey-dovey energy as she goes out to fight, instantly putting enemies to sleep.
She once was a legendary, life-changing prophet in the underworld, but she left that life and opened a small bar, often consulting her patrons on their relationship problems.
She always drinks strong alcohol and enjoys romance comics; she doesn't care much about the world outside her bar. Her hobbies include reading a new customer's luck in love or making people who hate each other fall in love. 
She, however, doesn't appreciate all kinds of love. Infidelity, for example, enrages her so much that she will turn her bar upside-down.]]
L23_1[1] = L24_1
L23_1[2] = L25_1
L24_1 = {}
L25_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_CA_MARIA"
L26_1 = "Garguantia Maria Antonov is a ranger capable of maintaining a battle line with her ability to quickly transport allies to the front lines and stun enemies.\nThe assault time-space accelerator Garguantia is a strategic weapon that links with Maria Antonov’s transport ability to maximize its power.\nHowever, due to having a fundamental design flaw, the user must shoulder an immense load while Garguantia is activated. To counter this flaw, the research team reverse-engineered the biotechnology given to them by Maria, allowing her to change her physical age.\nBy reappearing in her younger form, Maria has given sufficient reason for her troops to call her the \"Goddess of Modern Warfare\"."
L24_1[1] = L25_1
L24_1[2] = L26_1
L25_1 = {}
L26_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CANARY_S_SHIELD"
L27_1 = "Félicette is a defender that neutralizes enemies using airborne skills and has great synergy with Laika.\nShe is the small but trustworthy commander of Canary Squad. She can utilize a heavy shield without breaking a sweat, but she is so catty as much as she is skilled.\nShe is well aware of her own physical limitations, therefore, she trains day and night to improve her stamina and strength. Lack of sleep might negatively affect her growth, so guardians are advised to take extra care of her."
L25_1[1] = L26_1
L25_1[2] = L27_1
L26_1 = {}
L27_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SCAVENGER_MA_EVOLVE"
L28_1 = [[
Evolved One is an aggressive ranged defender that sacrifices her own Mechs to grow stronger. 
This leader of the criminal group, Scavengers, is different from other robots that have raged out of control because of the influence of the Corruption. She can actually think on her own and carries out destructive activities with clear purposes in mind. 
She's also obsessed with evolution and thinks that everything, including humanity, is disposable where her evolution is concerned. 
If compared to wildlife, Evolved One is an apex predator at the top of a food chain. She destroys other machines and devours them like a voracious carnivore does, 
save she's armed with fusion projectiles and heavy firearms instead of claws and fangs.]]
L26_1[1] = L27_1
L26_1[2] = L28_1
L27_1 = {}
L28_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_C_ALPHA_CHOI"
L29_1 = "Enhances surrounding melee units and pushes enemy lines while standing on the same spot."
L27_1[1] = L28_1
L27_1[2] = L29_1
L28_1 = {}
L29_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BORDER_C_BOWGUN"
L30_1 = [[
Ella is a counterattacking striker who uses CRF to absorb impact and convert it into photons.
Ella is a soldier of Nordnavik's Southern Border Guards. She is also the unit's only Counter and doctor.
Outside of combat, she spends the majority of her time crafting arrows. She is difficult to approach because she is quiet, strictly follows rules, and always wears a stern expression. Even her unit's members report that she rarely smiles.
However, none of them consider her to be a cold person. Her willingness to help those in need and the heartwarming potato dish she serves to the hungry represent her smile.]]
L28_1[1] = L29_1
L28_1[2] = L30_1
L29_1 = {}
L30_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BARCODE_C_CHILDREN"
L31_1 = "Eins and Zwei are strikers who gain special abilities when they're together on the battlefield. Eins and Zwei are identical in everything, including their stats and gear. They're best friends who bicker all the time, but never stay angry with each other for long. They're also wise and reliable older sisters to their eight siblings. Jehuty Biotech advertised these kids as successful Counter clones, when in actuality they were just twins who shared the same Counter Watch. Currently, their release is pending because someone pointed out this critical shortcoming."
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_M_FOX_HOWITZER"
L32_1 = "Delivers ranged attacks to Bosses and warships."
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
L31_1 = {}
L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BORDER_SA_HORSE"
L33_1 = [[
Curian is an aggressive sniper who deploys with his soldiers and leads allies with his command tactics.
The Musketeer Division is a special organization formed by Nordnavik, consisting of powerful Counters. Each Counter leads its own separate unit under the Kingdom's orders. Gerard Curian was also a member of this force.
He was reported MIA following the Day of Corruption, but he recently returned to the Royal Army, actively serving his country on the frontlines.]]
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
L32_1 = {}
L33_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_MILITIA_JIHUN"
L34_1 = "Choi Jihoon is a sniper who enhances his allies while periodically attacking enemies at the rear line. He's also a member of the Militia that hunts down Counter criminals. A former soldier and sniper, he uses his experience to teach shooting to new Militia recruits. He's straightforward, even harsh at times, but his honest advice helps his members stay on the right track. Despite his efforts, however, the Militia now only has a few members left. In the face of the harsh reality that costs him his men every day, he struggles to maintain his sanity for the sake of the others who rely on him."
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
L33_1 = {}
L34_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_GEASS_M_LANCELOT_RA"
L35_1 = [[
C.C. and Lancelot Frontier is a ranger that specializes in critical damage and continuous damage.
The mysterious girl known as C.C. made a contract with Lelouch and gave him the Geass ability.
No one knows the purpose of her contract with Lelouch.
Nevertheless, given that she calls herself his accomplice and joins Lelouch's rebellion, it is evident that there is an important reason.
Lancelot Frontier is C.C.'s personal Knightmare equipped with Lancelot's spare parts.
While this war machine faithfully inherits the basic armament of Lancelot, the added cockpit ejection feature ensures the survival of the pilot.]]
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JUNIOR_C_SPEAKER"
L36_1 = "Arti Lana is a sniper who's effective against Counters. Everything about her, including her age and whereabouts before the Academy, is unknown. She hates anything unscientific but loves hero comics. It is her hobby and daily routine to observe Counters and collect their data, and the ultimate goal of this study is to achieve her dream of becoming an assistant suitable for the strongest hero. To lay the groundwork for her future career, she established a club called the Special Hero Class to study children of her age, since young Counters these days tend to have extraordinary abilities compared to their seniors. Of course, to other people, the club just looks like a playground for the three children."
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
