L49_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_C_SNIPER"
L50_1 = [[
Agnes Abigail is a sniper who can leave marks on enemies with her basic attacks that permanently reduce their stats.
Agnes, the successor of the Valentinus Monastery, was a watcher who punished those who intrude the monastery for sacrilegious purposes. She was also a hunter who chose prey for sacrifice in a secret ritual.
And now that the monks to be protected from intruders and the rituals that require sacrifices have faded away beyond the fog of time, Agnes stays in the monastery, always waiting for someone. Perhaps the someone could be the one seeking forbidden knowledge that secretly lies in the monastery, or a visitor to whom she would like to serve egg tarts.]]
