L50_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_S_DOCTOR"
L51_1 = [[
Acolyte is a support who heals allies by consuming his own HP, while placing debuffs on enemies upon his death.
Acolytes are researchers at the forefront of the Society who seek new knowledge, and also secret daggers to drive out ignorant people who impede the quest for knowledge. Their costumes are the same as any other Society member, but behind the mask is a more dangerous and mysterious entity.
The Medical Department is responsible for providing the Society with Acolytes. They usually look for residents of the estate or outlanders who are willing to contribute to the Society. If they refuse, a touch of the Lake's Fragment will persuade them otherwise.]]
