L14_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_EVENT_ESPR2_1_1"
L15_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>* When an ESPR C.O. unit dies, it stuns◇ and damages other units of the same role.</color>\n\nAfter the priest's death, the residents constructed a fence around the forest and prohibited anyone from entering. Years passed, and as the eldest residents' memories of that nightmarish day began to fade, a shadow of famine fell over the area. Even as the wild grass withered, the dense forest remained unchanged.\nSome people who couldn't bear the hunger went into the forest in search of food. And nobody came back."
