Deals damage to enemies using ice attacks. When [Ice barrier] is active, creates an ice vortex to attack enemies. Adds 1 stack of [Chill] per hit. Does not deal damage to targets exceeding valid hit.

Chill and Freeze effects
Chill: Reduces SPD/ASPD by 3% per stack for 5 seconds. (Up to 20 stacks) Upon 20 stacks, the effect changes to [Freeze].
Freeze: Becomes frozen for 5 seconds. Immune to knockback/Airborne. During [Freeze], unable to accumulate [Chill]. (Bosses excluded)]]
