L29_1 = [[
<color=#ffd34c>* This dungeon can only be cleared with the assigned NPCs.

</color>Excerpts from an old local folklore.
On a moonless, foggy night, a boat approached the shore. Stepping foot on land, a group of people followed the young man's guide and disappeared into the dense forest. After that night, sacrilegious symbols too horrid to speak of were found within.
A village priest who went in search of the truth returned to the village, running and screaming like a madman, "Eyes! Those eyes!" And as the residents watched, the priest was devoured by an invisible monster.]]
