L33_1 = "「Oh no.」The reclusive Lord of Flies sighed.\n「What great timing.」The Lord's card for the unexpected attack had just been discarded.\n「Your tricks are familiar, yet a little rough around the edges. Almost as if you are an apprentice.」Its cold compound eyes peered through the cracks in the chain of events."
