L37_1 = "The mercenary was long gone before she realized that he had taken the necklace given to her by her mother. Having lost both her love and fortune, she decided to throw away the last thing she had.\nThat day, a beast that smelled her despair spoke to her.\n「Why are you crying? If you're going to die anyway, then help me!」"
