L51_1 = "SI_DP_GAUNTLET_ASYNC_INFO_LEAGUE_DESC"
L52_1 = "· Additional stats from gear, level-up, and enhancement can only be applied partially.\n· You must set up a Defense squad to join the Strategy Battle.\n· You can select and fight the Defense squad of one of three users within the same Victory Points bracket as you.\n· Strategy battles are automatically performed. Your units will be deployed in the order that they were added to their squad.\n· If you fight users with higher Victory Points than you, you'll win more Victory Points and lose fewer than usual.\n· If you fight users with lower Victory Points than you, you'll win fewer Victory Points and lose more than usual.\n· Win a certain amount of Victory Points, and you can move up to a higher league.\n· In certain leagues, you can be demoted without warning if your Victory Points go below their minimum point requirement."
