L49_1 = [[
<b><color=#4EC2F3>[Autumn Circuit Link Event]</color></b>
<color=#FFCF3B>- Collect and analyze Autumnal Records.</color>
<color=#FFCF3B>- Complete bingo lines and get rewards during this special event.</color>

<b><color=#FFFFFF>[Data Analysis]</color></b>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Play Main Stream, Free Contract, and Event episodes for a chance to find <color=#FFCF3B>Autumnal Records</color>.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Use an <color=#FFCF3B>Autumnal Record</color> and analyze its data to get a random number.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Each number opens its block when first obtained.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Unused <color=#FFCF3B>Autumnal Records</color> will be deleted during the scheduled maintenance after the event period.</color>

<b><color=#FFFFFF>[Ensured Analysis]</color></b>
<color=#F2F2F2>- If you find the same number more than once, you get <color=#FFCF3B>Duplicate Points</color>.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- You can use <color=#FFCF3B>Duplicate Points</color> to unlock the slots you want.</color>

<b><color=#FFFFFF>[Analysis Missions]</color></b>
<color=#F2F2F2>- The 4 slots in the center can only be unlocked by Analysis missions, and not by normal or Ensured Analysis.</color>

<b><color=#FFFFFF>[Rewards]</color></b>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Unlock all the data in the same line in any direction, and a <color=#FFCF3B>bingo</color> line will be completed.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Each bingo line offers a <color=#FFCF3B>reward</color> upon completion.</color>
<color=#F2F2F2>- Complete a certain number of bingo lines, and you'll also get a <color=#FFCF3B>Cumulative Bingo reward</color>.</color>]]
