L27_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_YG_HARIM_SPORTS"
L28_1 = [[
The rising star of the Academy!
The host and mascot of the Field Day!
Yang Harim and her three animal friends!
Are you ready to immerse yourself in the rhythmic cuteness? Let's go!

<color=#ffd34c>Ladies and gentlemen! Please give a round of applause for our CEO!</color>]]
L26_1[1] = L27_1
L26_1[2] = L28_1
L27_1 = {}
L28_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_FALLEN_ROSARIA_FOOLSDAY"
L29_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nThe one who sits on the couch in the Fallen Hawk Private Eye office is obliged to watch every soap drama real time. An endless supply of potato chips and the right to change channels are just perks that come with the privilege.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Servant, I told you to bring me potato chips, not this inflated bag of nothing.</color>"
L27_1[1] = L28_1
L27_1[2] = L29_1
L28_1 = {}
L29_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_JAPAN_SENHIME_SUMMER"
L30_1 = [[
It just happened that I got to spend my vacation at the beach.
I wasn't used to being near the sea, but it didn't take long for me to learn how to enjoy it.
Yes, I'm a warrior who's loyal to her master,
but I'm also a girl who loves having fun.

<color=#ffd34c>Striking at a watermelon with my eyes covered? What an interesting way of training!</color>]]
L28_1[1] = L29_1
L28_1[2] = L30_1
L29_1 = {}
L30_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_JAPAN_SETSUNA_SUMMER"
L31_1 = [[
As the leader of the Family, I must keep up appearances at all times,
but that's easier said than done.
Sometimes, I just want to have fun at the beach in a swimsuit like this.
I wonder if my sister would understand me.

<color=#ffd34c>This vacation is a secret just between the two of us. You won't tell anyone, will you?</color>]]
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
