L47_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_ACADEMY_C_TWINTAIL_SPORTS"
L48_1 = [[
The choice of her clothes shows her mindset when facing a match.
She pretends not to care,
but her outfit shows how serious she is.
She must have practiced so hard, right?

<color=#ffd34c>I'm an elite. I don't need to practice. ... These bandages? Y-you don't need to know!</color>]]
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_ALT_CA_SEO_YOON_SPORTS"
L49_1 = [[
A good competition requires a good rival.
The stronger your rival, the stronger your desire to win.
But what if you can't beat your rival in the end?
From then on, your rival will become a new protagonist.

<color=#ffd34c>Match point. Can you go for more?</color>]]
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ADMIN_ARTILLERY_1BIRTHDAY"
L50_1 = [[
Old glory and hope for a better future.
She'll embrace both as she moves on.
The Commander is more acquisitive than she looks.
Even now, she wants to focus on this most joyous moment of her life.

<color=#ffd34c>I keep this seat for you, comrade. Care for a glass of champagne?</color>]]
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ADMIN_GREATSWORD_SPORTS"
L51_1 = [[
Cooking isn't a necessary skill for an adjutant,
but there's no harm in being good at it.
She prepared a lunch box for you along with the ones for her men.
Although it's not certain if you can handle the amount of love in it.

<color=#ffd34c>It tasted all right to me. How will it taste to you?</color>]]
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
L50_1 = {}
L51_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ADMIN_GREATSWORD_X_MAS"
L52_1 = "Late in the night, she checks the list of presents that she's prepared for the special day.\nIt reads,\n\"Thoughtful presents for the good members; merciless noogies for the naughty ones.\"\nBut the present for the person at the top of the list is secret.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Hold your breath. I've got a one-of-a-kind present for you. Ho ho. ♪</color>"
L50_1[1] = L51_1
L50_1[2] = L52_1
