L5_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALPHA_JIA_DUMMY_RACING"
L6_1 = "Shin Jia AR Form Racing description"
L4_1[1] = L5_1
L4_1[2] = L6_1
L5_1 = {}
L6_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALPHA_JIA_RACING"
L7_1 = [[
She's an experienced flag marshal,
but the race committee is wary of her.
Every time she waves the flag,
the racers' eyes become fixated on a specific location.

<color=#ffd34c>Today, there are more cameras than before. Ho ho, this must mean I'm doing my job, right?</color>
]]
L5_1[1] = L6_1
L5_1[2] = L7_1
L6_1 = {}
L7_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_KIM_SOBIN_WINTER"
L8_1 = [[
You're supposed to throw snowballs during a snowball fight.
It's a simple activity without much risk for injury.
But there is always an exception.
Try not to trigger her competitive spirit.

<color=#ffd34c>I-I just lost control of myself...</color>]]
L6_1[1] = L7_1
L6_1[2] = L8_1
L7_1 = {}
L8_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_SEO_YOON_OLD"
L9_1 = "(Old) Seo Yoon Skin Description"
L7_1[1] = L8_1
L7_1[2] = L9_1
L8_1 = {}
L9_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_SEO_YOON_SPRING"
L10_1 = [[
From thrilling lunch broadcasts
to script writing and festival event filming.
Just trust me to do whatever is needed.
That is the role of a leader.

<color=#ffd34c>Mic check, can you hear me?</color>]]
L8_1[1] = L9_1
L8_1[2] = L10_1
L9_1 = {}
L10_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_SEO_YOON_X_MAS"
L11_1 = [[
The long awaited day of the year.
Isn't it so sad to just let it pass like this?
Remember the day that will return again,
along with the snow that greeted us.

<color=#ffd34c>I look forward to keep working with you, this year and the next! </color>]]
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
L10_1 = {}
L11_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_XIAOLIN_NEWYEAR2021"
L12_1 = [[
Is she a celestial maiden who has descended from the moon after sunset?
While everyone else is making a wish on the brightly lit night sky,
she stands before you, facing against the moon.
This quiet, private moment between you was the very thing she wished for.

<color=#ffd34c>I shouldn't let my guard down when I'm out in the field, but I'll make an exception this night.</color>]]
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
L11_1 = {}
L12_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_XIAOLIN_WEDDING"
L13_1 = [[
The ceremony of eternal bonding must not be interrupted.
Here is a sniper who can keep all threats at bay.
Although she's been secretly in love with someone, 
let's just pretend that we haven't noticed.

<color=#ffd34c>S-snipers shouldn't wear saggy clothes like this.</color>]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
L12_1 = {}
L13_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_XIAOLIN_WINTER"
L14_1 = [[
I prefer the quiet and calm winter.
It's even better if it's snowing.
Draw in the cold air until it gets warm,
and lightly draw the trigger finger.

<color=#ffd34c>...Target neutralized.</color>]]
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
L13_1 = {}
L14_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_C_ALT_YOO_JIN_SPRING"
L15_1 = [[
It's a drowsy 5th period of school after lunch.
When she turns the head towards the sunny window,
she meets the eyes of a stray cat on the flower bed again.
Can the two of them ever become friends?

<color=#ffd34c>W-What? You've never seen a person playing with a cat?</color>]]
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
