L16_1 = [[
Blue Rose Island glows a blue color during the nights of the festival,
which coincides with the active period of the blue butterfly.
These butterflies can't live outside the island because of their limited food choices and numerous predators.
Such vulnerability, however, only adds to their preciousness.

<color=#ffd34c>Aren't they beautiful? I know a thing or two about growing things.</color>]]
