L17_1 = [[
The nobility first started eating chocolates.
They drank cacao beverages together with sugar.
Oh, am I boring you with my story?
That's why I prepared a Bunny Girl with tea.

<color=#ffd34c>The lady is currently enjoying tea time. Missions can wait. </color>]]
