L18_1 = [[
Even veteran journalists like her don't know about everything.
Like what it's like to be newly married, for example.
She's like a tornado when she's out for interesting topics,
but in front of the man of her dreams, maybe she'll be as gentle as a spring breeze.

<color=#ffd34c>I should take wedding photos with someone I like, shouldn't I?</color>]]
