Once he got accosted by a gang of street thugs.
They pushed their guns into his face, saying they didn't like the way he looked with his sunglasses on.
And they learned a brilliant lesson that day.
That there's a reason a man wears sunglasses.

<color=#ffd34c>Stay away, or you'll get electrified.</color>]]
