Cyber Cat is an unprecedented hacker
who has left footprints across the federal network
and handed over the personal information of some malicious crackers to police, saving the day.
Who would believe she did all this just for the fun of it?

<color=#ffd34c>There's only one thing I'm not good at, and it's listening to the grownups.</color>]]
