L25_1 = [[
Human emotions are always interesting material,
which are especially abundant in summer vacation sites like this.
I see people in a love triangle passing by...
Err, Dark Lord, what are you looking at?

<color=#ffd34c>I can't eat all this shaved ice by myself. Want to come here and take a bite?</color>]]
