L40_1 = [[
The threat of Corrupted Objects doesn't stop even during the summer vacation season.
That's why luxurious hotels shower their Counter guests with all kinds of benefits.
Just the fact that they have a Counter staying with them assures their other guests.

<color=#ffd34c>I was only going to stay for a little while, but if you insist...</color>]]
