L41_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nWhat should you do to remain peaceful in a rapidly changing world?\nLet's ask that employee over there. He looks pretty relaxed. Perhaps he can tell us his secret.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Hah hah, ordinary employees like me just do what we're told.</color>"
