L42_1 = [[
It's important that children get the presents that they have waited for the whole year,
but it's even more important that they enjoy peace.
We didn't want the sound of C.O.s howling to ruin this holy night,
so, we invited a special worker this year.

<color=#ffd34c>I'm doing this for everyone. I hope you don't mind a little bit of vandalism.</color>]]
