L4_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※ This skin only changes the character illustration. ※</color>\n\nAfter school, we Rabbits are always together.\nTell us if you see any animal that needs rescuing. We'll go wherever it is!\nBut our friends who help us need rest sometimes.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Try not to leave your kibbles, okay guys?</color>"
