L5_1 = [[
There is a deep connection between rabbits and chocolates.
What was that? Am I talking about Easter? Nope!
There is data that people who like rabbits also like chocolates.
This statistic was gathered by Agent Yang Harim.

<color=#ffd34c>Hi! I'm handing out chocolates made out of C.O. Don't worry, it's sugar-free! </color>]]
