Sometimes it's not too bad to go down memory lane.
Believe it or not, she used to play the cello.
Even then, there was a discussion that she might need a cello that better fit her size...
Of course, no one was suicidal enough to mention that in front of her.

<color=#ffd34c>You want to watch me play? Okay, so long as it's between you and me.</color>]]
