L18_1 = "It's really fun to roll around the grass with pandas.\nA day goes by quickly when you play with the playful baby pandas.\nIrie is even disguised as a panda to make the best of her time with her friends.\nShe looks just like a real one, doesn't she?\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Can anyone tell who the real Irie is? ♪</color>"
