L25_1 = [[
She opened her eyes and realized she'd fallen into a strange world, yet again.
But her story is not going to end the same way as the fairy tale did.
This Red Riding Hood is a hunter armed with a strategy bulwark and an assault rifle.
Of course, getting scared easily is a different story.

<color=#ffd34c>D-did someone touch me right now?</color>]]
L23_1[1] = L24_1
L23_1[2] = L25_1
