L28_1 = [[
To dainty girls like me, the night wind is too cold, and the spring water is too hot,
but they can't stop me from blushing with excitement.
I promise you. I'll never forget this vacation I spent with you here today. 

<color=#ffd34c>"But... the night sky and the flowers look so pretty. I'd love to talk to others."</color>]]
