L29_1 = [[
The deputy captain is strict to everyone, even to herself.
I swear you won't get many chances to see her look so relaxed.
So promise me that you'll keep this little getaway secret between you two. 

<color=#ffd34c>"We're not here to play, Dame Arius. We're here just to be polite."</color>]]
