Reinforce your forces
with lower Cost and higher manpower.]]
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
L33_1 = {}
L34_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_PVP_RANK_2_DESC"
L35_1 = [[
If you win a Ranked Battle, you will get Gauntlet Points.
<COLOR=#FFBC00>Reward Points are consumed when you obtain Gauntlet Points</COLOR>. Once you use them all, you can no longer obtain Gauntlet Points.
225 Reward Points are charged every 6 hours.

If you have <COLOR=#FFBC00>Additional Reward Points</COLOR>, then you can earn double the Gauntlet Points.]]
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_EQUIP_TUNING_3_DESC_01"
L36_1 = [[
When you try Change Options, you can preview new options.
If you like the new option, press <COLOR=#FFBC00>Confirm</COLOR> to change.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
L35_1 = {}
L36_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_OFFICE_DORMI_3_DESC"
L37_1 = [[
You can visit your Partners' and other CEOs' Dorms. Exchange Business Cards and deepen your partnership with them.
Obtained Business Cards can be exchanged for Partner's Business Cards and used for employee recruitment. Up to 500 Business Cards a day can be obtained at the Dorm.]]
L35_1[1] = L36_1
L35_1[2] = L37_1
L36_1 = {}
L37_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_OPERATION_FIELD_1_DESC"
L38_1 = [[
Free Contracts are operations commissioned by other companies.
They are Battlefield battles that are more difficult and restricted than Main Stream ones.]]
L36_1[1] = L37_1
L36_1[2] = L38_1
L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_OPERATION_MAINSTREAM_2_DESC"
L39_1 = [[
Complete Battle missions and get <COLOR=#FFBC00>Medals to receive [Accomplishment Rate rewards]</COLOR>.
<COLOR=#FFBC00>Up to 3 Medals can be obtained per operation</COLOR>, and your Medals are totaled per Episode.]]
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_OPERATION_MAINSTREAM_1_DESC"
L40_1 = [[
Covers the main story about the members of the Coffin Company and the Counterside.
[Main Stream] operations mainly take place in <COLOR=#FFBC00>Battle mode</COLOR>.]]
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
L39_1 = {}
L40_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_UNIT_LIMITBREAK_3_DESC"
L41_1 = [[
Employees can be <COLOR=#FFBC00>Limit-Fused</COLOR> at the cost of Fusion Cores or units of the same kind.
<COLOR=#FFBC00>Limit Fusion</COLOR> increases <COLOR=#FFBC00>Max Level by 2</COLOR> and <COLOR=#FFBC00>stat growth rate by 2%</COLOR> every time it's performed.
 <COLOR=#FFBC00>Limit Fusion</COLOR> can be performed <COLOR=#FFBC00>up to 5 times</COLOR>.]]
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
