L42_1 = "SI_PF_TUTORIAL_TEXUTRE_RAID_HELP_1_DESC"
L43_1 = [[
Branch Dispatch missions create a chance of generating a Raid event when completed.
The higher the Branch's level, the higher the triggered Raid's difficulty level.
The discovered Raids are displayed on the World Map, and can be managed through the World Status menu.]]
