Units can be Limit-broken as many times as their <COLOR=#FFBC00>empty stars</COLOR>.
Limit Break improves <COLOR=#FFBC00>all stats</COLOR>.
It also <COLOR=#FFBC00>increases max skill levels</COLOR>, and sometimes even unlocks the 4th Gear slot.]]
