L10_1 = [[
Lamda Spatari is a Ranger who can deal more damage depending on the enemy's HP. 
As the CEO of Jonie & Melonie, Lamda is a lawyer who takes care of various duties for powerful figures in politics and business. She may seem like someone with a lot of enemies, but she actually has the trust and respect of her sister and colleagues. 
She always treats people with a cold and calm attitude, but what actually drives her is the burning passion within.
That's why she doesn't get along with those who are heartless, however, she would still cooperate with them for a common goal. One should be able to separate business and pleasure, after all.]]
