L38_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_1_1"
L39_1 = [[
Many nations could not avoid the destruction as the Corruption disaster spread rapidly.
People gathered to survive, and the United Humankind Government that was based on the Federal Government was born.]]
L37_1[1] = L38_1
L37_1[2] = L39_1
L38_1 = {}
L39_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_INTERLUDE1"
L40_1 = [[
Unknown lumps of mass started to cover the world one by one. We had no name for them at the time.
Some abhorred them, whereas others worshiped them.
We only found out later that they were cocoons of some organism.]]
L38_1[1] = L39_1
L38_1[2] = L40_1
L39_1 = {}
L40_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_1_2"
L41_1 = [[
The United Humankind Government established cocoon observatories to manage the cocoons in each district.
But even with all this effort, no one could stop the awakening of the Nephil.]]
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
L40_1 = {}
L41_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_INTERLUDE2"
L42_1 = [[
Everyone has a hometown.
But whether they can go back to it or not is a completely different question.]]
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
L41_1 = {}
L42_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_1_3"
L43_1 = [[
For when they rise from the dead,
they neither marry nor are given in marriage, but are like angels in heaven.]]
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_1_4"
L44_1 = [[
In general, C.O.s have no intelligence.
They move on instinct and destroy anything living that stands in their way.
Generally speaking, that is.]]
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "SI_EPISODE_EPISODE_DESC_NKM_DUNGEON_SS_EXILER_INTERLUDE3"
L45_1 = [[
