L13_1 = "SI_UNIT_SKILL_DESC_DELTA_CA_KYLE_AP_PASSIVE_LV1"
L14_1 = "When an enemy is within 400 distance, switches her rifle parts to fire a powerful laser to all enemies in the path, slightly knock them back, and inflicts Barrier Reflux to hit enemies (Ships excluded, immune to Special or lower skills while casting). This attack has a 12-second cooldown. After 8 attacks with basic attacks and Passive attacks (16 for PVE), or if Karin's HP falls below 70% and 40%, she dodges back in the direction of the allied ship and then, casts her Passive Skill if a ground target is present (Ships are excluded from target)."
