L16_1 = [[
Nina Anderson is a vanguard who fights by taking advantage of her flexibility.

She is the leader of the Frontier mercenaries who all come from the 6th refugee district. She used to earn her living from street dancing. One day, she received an old watch when she helped out a homeless person who was shivering with cold. She only realized it was the Watch when a catastrophe hit her hometown.
After becoming a Counter, Nina chose the life of a mercenary to escape poverty. Although she never talks about her hometown, her friends have often seen her practicing the dance she created before. ]]
