L17_1 = [[
Anti-tank firearms and snipers don't go well together, but Maya Hunt is an exception.

She acquired a Watch due to her desire to create more awesome explosions. The size, decibel, and color of the explosion greatly affect her condition. This explosive maniac suddenly appeared at the refugee district and attacked the gangsters. Other gang members who tried to take revenge succumbed to her overwhelming firepower. Residents cheered at first, but later suffered from noise.
Fortunately, she was scouted by the Frontier where she didn't have to resist her impulse. In the Corrupted Areas, no one ever complains about explosions. ]]
