L23_1 = "The first companion to join Mi Rinae’s conquest of finding the Master Sword!\nDain supports Rinae with her keen observational abilities, extensive knowledge, and ability to communicate with animals. With her gentle nature, Dain enjoys cutesy things, but this sometimes puts her party into sticky situations.\n* Excerpted from the guidebook of <Counters Saga>."
