L23_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_KIM_CHEOLSU_RA"
L24_1 = "Salaryman X is an offfice-worker hero protecting the peace of the family!\nOur hero’s true identity is none but an ordinary office worker!\nEver since awakening his abilities as a Counter, Salaryman X has been living the secret life of a hero in disguise. His handmade mask and armor serves no function, as they are worn to conceal his identity for the sake of his family.\nEveryday, Salaryman X walks his path of determination to prove that every breadwinner can become a superhero– even without wealth or superpowers.\n* Excerpted from the guidebook of <Counters Saga>."
