L26_1 = [[
Many Society members are obsessed with something. In that respect, Rivet fits surprisingly well with them. Instead of becoming complacent, she would throw herself into danger to experience the rush, and always be chasing for that next thrill.
Rivet's background is still shrouded in mystery even after joining the Society. Her life adversities are so outrageous that they have no bearing on her evaluations. The Business Department strongly advised that her Unique Gear be taken away from her, but it was ultimately vetoed by the President.
Because this enigmatic individual is not a potential threat to the Society, but rather an intriguing research topic.]]
