L42_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SECURITY_C_SERGEANT"
L43_1 = [[
Chris is a supportive ranger who secures survivability by keeping a distance between herself and her enemies. Her Ultimate Skill deals irregular damage to enemies within range and recovers cost.
Sergeant Christina Brecht is the only living being to have received the Medal of Honor since the founding of Gronia. Although she never received proper training as a conscript before she was thrown in to the front lines, she came back alive from even the most gruesome battles, astonishing her superiors. Some high-ranking officers were among those she rescued, particularly during the Spring Battle, which was a nightmare for the government military.
The government attempted to boost soldier morale by making the girl a war hero who would live on in history. And now that she's been temporarily assigned to the Department of National Security, it means a lot more than just obvious propaganda.]]
L41_1[1] = L42_1
L41_1[2] = L43_1
L42_1 = {}
L43_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BAR_S_BARTENDER"
L44_1 = [[
She was recognized by the Holy Curia and officially anointed as an exorcist at a fairly young age. 
A rising star in the Exorcism Council honored with an Artifact, she had a promising future. 
To live up to her order's expectations, she read thousands of books and learned how to assimilate into secular society for the day she'd be called for duty. 
And when the day came, she was tasked with finding a devil hiding among people. 
And the only thing her priest gave to her before she left was a business card with just two words, Gremory's Bar.]]
L42_1[1] = L43_1
L42_1[2] = L44_1
L43_1 = {}
L44_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_MOMO"
L45_1 = [[
Momo is a (self-titled) Demon Lord whose invincible army includes a violent dragon doll named Huff Puff and Four Champions that not all of them are yet to be named. She's so great that she's always threatened by jealous external forces, such as randomly dropping flowerpots, harmless-looking puddles in the street, and pigeons and raccoons with a sweet tooth. 
Of course, it's Momo who always prevails in the end! Her faithful subjects like Gremory make sure of it. Momo can make her subjects do anything for her if she wants to! She checks their mood before she does, though. An admirable trait for a charismatic Demon Lord, don't you think?]]
L43_1[1] = L44_1
L43_1[2] = L45_1
L44_1 = {}
L45_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_NKM_UNIT_BAR_C_CEO"
L46_1 = "A support unit that neutralizes enemies at her deployment spot"
L44_1[1] = L45_1
L44_1[2] = L46_1
L45_1 = {}
L46_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ESPR_SHADOW"
L47_1 = "Edel Meitner is a sniper who commands strange beings residing in her shadow to inflict AoE damage. Her strange familiars are especially powerful against Soldiers and Corrupted Objects.\n\nThe newly appointed President of Eckhart's Society for Preternatural\nResearch and an insatiable glutton, she even treats Corrupted Objects as food ingredients. Unlike other people, she sees Anti-Corruption battles as opportunities to feast, which was the very reason she presented herself to the TASKFORCE industry, to satisfy her hunger while avoiding her successor at the Society who's trying to restrict her diet. Her appetite may not be comprehensible to most people, but she claims that she eats to accumulate knowledge,rather than to sustain life.\nShe's only categorized as Counter for the sake of administrative convenience. So far, no one knows what exactly those creatures that follow her are."
L45_1[1] = L46_1
L45_1[2] = L47_1
L46_1 = {}
L47_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ESPR_FROZEN"
L48_1 = "Regina MacCready is a supporter specializing in summoning ice walls and weakening her enemies' abilities to attack. Her ice energy is especially effective against Mechs.\n\nThe Watch that has been passed down in her family is optimized for the power of ice. Depending on the user, not only it can create ice, but it can also cause nationwide weather phenomena.\nThe problem is that its current owner, Regina, is yet to fully control its power. She has to stay conscious of her power, or she starts to freeze the moment she lets her guard down. For her, there are no better presents than a plush blanket and coffee.\nHer family has produced Presidents of Eckhart's Society for Preternatural Research since its establishment, but Regina has never been a fan of this tradition. Maybe she's desperate to control her Watch because she wants to abolish her family's old tradition. Or she's just tired of feeling cold all the time."
L46_1[1] = L47_1
L46_1[2] = L48_1
L47_1 = {}
L48_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_C_ESPR_SHADOW"
L49_1 = "A sniper specializing in eliminating Soldiers and C.O.'s in groups."
L47_1[1] = L48_1
L47_1[2] = L49_1
L48_1 = {}
L49_1 = "SI_UNIT_DESC_S_MILITIA_JIHUN"
L50_1 = "Enhances allies' ranged attackers and deals heavy damage on enemies in the rear."
L48_1[1] = L49_1
L48_1[2] = L50_1
L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_JAPAN_CHIHIRO"
L51_1 = [[
 Hayami Sanae is a sniper providing her forces with powerful area-effective fire support from the rear line.

Her family, Hayami, was a member of the Family Alliance, but it fell off the grid a decade ago after causing devastating damage to the Alliance. Sanae disappeared after the incident, but she returned a couple of years later, carrying a massive firearm which she called the Sadiron.
The Family Alliance took her back as a maid at the Main House, with the connivance of the Alliance Leader at the time.
She takes care of everything around the mansion, from cleaning and cooking to house maintenance. Many Family members have been heard saying that she's now an indispensable part of the Main House, but most of them still seem to be wary of the possibility of Sanae bringing harm to their Alliance once again.
]]
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
L50_1 = {}
L51_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_JAPAN_SENHIME"
L52_1 = [[
 Nanahara Chifuyu, the bodyguard of the Family leader, is a vanguard who defeats the Family Alliance's enemies solely with her sword.

She specializes in the Nanahara Style, the swordsmanship style only taught to a select group of swordsmen in her Family. Ancient martial arts authorities in modern times believe that this style has nothing to do with one's lineage and has everything to do with one being a Counter.
Chifuyu is a Grade D Noncombat Counter, but her mastery of sword skills, which she has acquired through a strenuous effort, has put her next to higher-grade Counters.
The Family Alliance, having spared no effort to restore this combat style, is not happy that she uses it for personal protection, even though it is to protect her leader.]]
L50_1[1] = L51_1
L50_1[2] = L52_1
