L2_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_SCHOOL_PRESIDENT"
L3_1 = [[
 Yen Xing Lanchester is the president of the Counter Academy Student Council. She's also a swift swordswoman who uses daggers to blow away beneficial effects cast on enemies.

Among the students of the Academy, Yen Xing is known as a stern senior, but personally, she wants everyone to treat her like a friend. The charisma and seriousness she exudes is only due to her upbringing; on the inside she's just like other girls her age who love children and animals.
But even the numerous rumors about her that circulate in school can't refute that she's a born leader.As a master of the traditional martial arts, she earns a lot of money teaching children of rich familiies, but she donates almost all her wealth to the Academy and the society. Also, she doesn't treat other students differently because of who they are.
She believes it's necessary for everyone to accept each other's differences to achieve perfect harmony. Her belief doesn't seem to be empty idealism, given how successful she has been as the leader of a Council filled with unique characters that rarely agree with each other.]]
L1_1[1] = L2_1
L1_1[2] = L3_1
L2_1 = {}
L3_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_SIXWING_NA_YUBIN"
L4_1 = [[
 Na Yubin is a vanguard who excels in prolonged battles. He creates a barrier as he attacks, and deteriorates his enemies' defense through AoE attacks.

The leader of the mysterious armed organization, Six Wings, he works with a few like-minded members to achieve a goal that only they know.
He owns unique gear of unknown origin, and has been a suspect in various unsolved cases. He's dangerous, enough that you should be cautious when recruiting him into your forces.
He's currently working as a customer service representative at a city hall, not hiding his real identity.]]
L2_1[1] = L3_1
L2_1[2] = L4_1
L3_1 = {}
L4_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_STREGA_EVELYN"
L5_1 = [[
 Witch Evelyn is a healing supporter who flies around on her broom, recovering allies and causing constant damage on enemies with her potions.

She is the barista, pastry chef, and accountant at Witch Cafe Strega. Because she knows how to touch people's hearts, she has single-handedly acquired many regular customers to the cafe.
But Laura doesn't trust her to take care of the cafe on her own, because Evelyn often mixes her experimental potions into customers' drinks for clinical experiments. The cafe regularly receives complaints about employees adding weird substances to the coffee.
But it hasn't cause too much problems since most of the reviews are favorable, whether it be a love coming true or recovering health after visiting the cafe. ]]
L3_1[1] = L4_1
L3_1[2] = L5_1
L4_1 = {}
L5_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_STREGA_INGRID"
L6_1 = [[
 Witch Ingrid is a vanguard with high evasion and attack speed who can appear at any location on the battlefield by borrowing the power of time.

Witches usually begin to learn the occult arts out of curiosity, or become mesmerized by the dark powers of black magic. But Ingrid chose to become a witch because she just wanted to become stronger than anyone. 
She always fails to control her competitive spirit and searches for strong opponents to fight. But that is also why she ended up working at a cafe. She was defeated after blindly challenging the most powerful witch to a duel. And as a consequence, she had to sign a contract to work at the cafe to pay off the damages she caused during the duel.
She often serves food while doing a handstand because she believes a comfortable work environment weakens her. And doing so usually results in her getting knocked down by the owner. But there are VVIP Customers who visit the cafe on purpose to see her eccentric actions. ]]
L4_1[1] = L5_1
L4_1[2] = L6_1
L5_1 = {}
L6_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_STREGA_LAURA"
L7_1 = [[
 Laura Beatrix is a debilitating supporter who summons her cat familiar, Pluto, to inflict enemies with curses that slow and weaken them.

She is the owner of Cafe Strega who keeps claiming that she is not a cosplayer but a real witch. The employees of her cafe dress up as witches and often use real magic to make their work easier. But the customers believe that it's all part of the cosplay, accompanied by illusions. Even her familiar has become the mascot of the cafe, known as the cat that predicts misfortune.
Although Laura was unhappy with people who didn't believe in the existence of witches, she has recently accepted reality and has been working on the new menu as sales are on the rise. You can't blame a witch for wanting to make more money. ]]
L5_1[1] = L6_1
L5_1[2] = L7_1
L6_1 = {}
L7_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_STREGA_YOO_NA"
L8_1 = [[
 Yuna Springfield, an apprentice witch of Strega, is a ranged attacker who prepares devastating magic using the Witch's Staff that has been passed down her family.

She decided to become a witch to follow the will of her deceased grandmother, and recklessly visited a real witch and asked her to be her master. But for some reason, the new master made her a waitress in the Witch Cafe she owns, saying that it's all part of the training.
Yuna always begins her chores filled with enthusiasm, but quickly gets exhausted and overwhelmed. She is full of spirit, but lacking in seriousness.
When a counselor asked her what she wanted to do when she became a real witch, she answered that she'd think about it after she became one. Many are paying attention to this young witch's future. Of course, most of them bet their money on her failure.]]
L6_1[1] = L7_1
L6_1[2] = L8_1
L7_1 = {}
L8_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_VATICAN_BENEDICT"
L9_1 = [[
 Benedict Constantine is a versatile defender who protects allies from being critically wounded while stunning enemies.

The Miracle Investigation Council is an institution which was established to protect the Lord's people from Counterside Effects. As a member of the Council, Benedict ravages the frontline with his iron devotion and extraordinary swordsmanship. His dedicated service is admired by many people. 
But there have been suspicious circumstances as to whether he is walking the right path of faith. The clerics of the Council are anxious that Benedict seems to have changed his views on the doctrines after entering the secret library in Vatican City.]]
L7_1[1] = L8_1
L7_1[2] = L9_1
L8_1 = {}
L9_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_VATICAN_CINDY"
L10_1 = [[
 Cindy Looper is a vanguard who fights while healing herself. The chainsaw created from the Watch steals away its victim's will to resist.

This little nun was found in a closed cult as the sole survivor. When she was found, she had multiple B splatter films recorded in VHS. Further investigation showed that these films greatly contributed in developing Cindy's personality.
She often skips services and is terrible at saying prayers. But when it comes to smiting the enemies of the Lord, she displays outstanding skills. She is confident that the roaring ignition of her chainsaw serves as a hymn.]]
L8_1[1] = L9_1
L8_1[2] = L10_1
L9_1 = {}
L10_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_VATICAN_CLOUDIA"
L11_1 = [[
 Claudia Nelson is a supporter who can protect and heal multiple allies through prayers.

She is a young nun who thrives on helping others. When the news was delivered that she received a Watch, the Council was confused whether this could be interpreted as a miracle or not.
Besides working for the Council, she continues to lend a hand at nearby orphanages and churches. The clerics are grateful for her devoted help, but they never allow her to enter the kitchen. She is the only person who doesn't know that her cooking causes mental trauma to those eat it.]]
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
L10_1 = {}
L11_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_YG_HARIM"
L12_1 = [[
 Yang Harim is the leader of Club White Rabbit that rescues abandoned pets. She is a supporter who fights alongside three brave animal friends.

Due to her excessive love for animals, she spends her entire Counter Support Fund from the Administration on buying pet food, and jumps right into the sewers whenever she hears a cry for help. Her dream is to own a ranch large enough for all rescued animals to play in.
It must be difficult to keep up with her studies and also rescue the animals, but even today, she runs off to participate in after-school club activities. ]]
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
L11_1 = {}
L12_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_YG_HOJIN"
L13_1 = [[
 Cho Hojin is an all-around ranged attacker who makes up for lack of combat abilities with luck.

She can never ignore anyone in trouble, which made her join the animal rescue club, White Rabbit. Now she is doing her best to keep up with school while rescuing animals. In White Rabbit, she is the clumsy member and the person in charge of snacks.
So far, she has stopped more than 100 cases of possible civilian causalities, but it is a mystery why such accidents always happen around her. 
She acquired her Watch at a young age, but it hasn't been long since she realized that she is actually a Counter.]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
L12_1 = {}
L13_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_YOO_MI_NA"
L14_1 = [[
 Yoo Mina, a new member of Fenrir Squad, is an attacker who decimates enemies from a distance with a pulse revolver.

She is capable to taking down multiple enemies at once by using the secret feature of her weapon. Although she never received proper combat training and is lacking in industry knowledge, the Coffin Company is her third employer.
According to an anonymous community, she disobeyed orders from superiors at her previous workplace to distinguish herself in battle, and staged an armed protest when her payments were delayed.
These reckless behaviors are assumed to be due to massive medical bills she's paying for her family, but she has never spoken up about the issue.]]
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
L13_1 = {}
L14_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_ARIUS"
L15_1 = [[
 The Knight of Aquarius. Arius Esquede is a healing supporter who recovers allies and grants barriers with holy water that encompasses her will.

Despite being a Counter, she is physically weaker than normal people. Even before awakening to her powers, she had a fragile body that prevented her from strolling outside.
She is the daughter of a rich man who sponsors the Zodiac Knights, but she has long yearned to be one of them. As soon as she awakened her powers, she joined the Knights with the hope that she could venture into the world to help others.
Because of her innate curiosity, which no one realized when she was recuperating at home, the other members are always concerned about the safety of their patron's daughter who keeps disappearing.
She, on the other hand, wishes that the other knights will stop looking at her as someone to protect, but as a fellow knight who can be relied upon. ]]
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
L14_1 = {}
L15_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_CHARLOTTE"
L16_1 = [[
 The Knight of Virgo. Esterosa de Chevalier is a vanguard who fights on the frontline while protecting herself with a barrier.

Although she didn't hail from a knight's family, she unprecedentedly succeeded her predecessor to become the captain of the Zodiac Knights.
For this reason, she continues to receive pressure from the disapproving elders. Due to the enormous responsibility that she carries on her shoulders, she maintains a strict and serious attitude. But on the inside, she is actually very kind and soft-hearted.
She believes that she is hiding her true self well, but all the knights who have spent time with her already know that she can't take her eyes off cute animals and she talks in sleep when having a nightmare. ]]
L14_1[1] = L15_1
L14_1[2] = L16_1
L15_1 = {}
L16_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_LIV"
L17_1 = [[
 The Knight of Libra. Liv Allen is a vanguard who drives the enemy back with her endless stamina.

She looks like a tomboy who always wants to play, and she actually acts like one, but she is also a righteous knight who never turns away from the weak.
The people of the Allen family claim that their disciplined guidance and education helped her become a true knight. Ironically, none of the other Zodiac Knights have seen her attend chivalry classes even when she was a squire.
But seeing her easily wielding the Staff of Lira, a weapon that gains weight based on the malevolence of its wielder, one cannot but think that she was born with a knight's heart. ]]
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
L16_1 = {}
L17_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_PIONE"
L18_1 = [[
 The Knight of Scorpio. Fione Lowell is a supportive defender who enhances ally's defense.

She is the deputy captain of the Zodiac Knights. Grown up in a military family, she firmly believes that discipline is what it takes to control a group. Therefore, she emphasizes regular training and individual integrity, while strictly penalizing the lightest deviations. Other knights are stressed out by her upright attitude, but because they are also aware of their grave responsibilities, they approve of her methods to a certain degree.
The Lowell family has a lot of expectations towards Fione and wants her to pull down Estherosa to become the captain herself. But Fione respects Estherosa as much as she respects discipline, and she is satisfied with her current position of deputy captain. ]]
L16_1[1] = L17_1
L16_1[2] = L18_1
L17_1 = {}
L18_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_C_ZODIAC_YANG_HANSOL"
L19_1 = [[
 The Knight of Aries. Yang Hansol is an attacker who pushes back enemies with sword aura.

He recently awakened his power and joined the Zodiac Knights as a squire. Uncertain of his abilities, he swings his bamboo sword 10,000 times a day in hopes that he will become a real knight one day. However, the test has already confirmed that his potential power far outweighs those of average Counters.
He is the only one who doesn't know that. What he really needs is time, not workouts. But the other knights have all agreed to stay silent until he figures things out on his own, because they don't want to unnecessarily hamper his enthusiasm to improve himself.]]
L17_1[1] = L18_1
L17_1[2] = L19_1
L18_1 = {}
L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CA_HILDE"
L20_1 = [[
 Hilde, when geared up with Tech Level 5 Buster Cores, becomes a defender who pushes enemies away and uses her barrier and high defense capability to endure prolonged battles.

Dragon Buster Regin and Fafnir are solely created to withstand the power of Hilde's Qliphoth Factor. Records says they hibernated for a long time before they were reactivated by a recent battle with the Replacers.
This duo serves as an accelerator and a discharger, and they perform best when paired up with each other.
Theoretically, they have endless potential because they have no output limits. But since they can only be activated by the specific Factor inside Hilde, they're useless to other Counters.]]
L18_1[1] = L19_1
L18_1[2] = L20_1
L19_1 = {}
L20_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CA_STREGA_YOO_NA"
L21_1 = [[
 Yuna Springfield, the carrier of the grimoire of the sun, Solar Codex, is a vanguard commanding fire magic.

Not yet skilled enough to control the powerful heat she generates, she often burns herself along with her enemies. It's thanks to the controller of the Codex, Rayleigh, she's able to regulate her power of fire. The proud controller of the Codex always complains about Yuna's inaptitude, but when she's in danger, he fights for her more fiercely than anyone else.]]
L19_1[1] = L20_1
L19_1[2] = L21_1
L20_1 = {}
L21_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CA_YOO_MI_NA"
L22_1 = [[
 Yoo Mina, since she awakened to her Qliphoth Factor, has become all the more powerful as a vanguard, now swinging her sword without restriction.

Even after that fateful battle with the Replacers, she stayed in the TASKFORCE industry, and has grown into a veteran member of her team who's nothing like the clueless rookie she once was.
She's also broken out of her shell which kept her from getting close to others at the company when she first joined. Now, she's an exemplary leader who has all her team members on her side.
She, however, hasn't changed as far as spending and finances go, working instead of taking vacation days and buying cheap package meals at convenience stores.
She's embarrassed to talk about this side of her. Please try not to comment about her coin purse.]]
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
L21_1 = {}
L22_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_ADMIN_CANNON"
L23_1 = [[
 Specializing in ultra-long-range bombardments, these sniper units can provide stronger firepower as they stay longer in battle.

They are the ultimate defense units of the Old Administration. The massive firepower of this unit can destroy targets from miles away. Theoretically, its 155mm particle gun is even effective against Category 4 C.O. as well.]]
L21_1[1] = L22_1
L21_1[2] = L23_1
L22_1 = {}
L23_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_ADMIN_MACHINEGUN"
L24_1 = [[
 A vanguard that grows stronger when shooting fire without moving.

They are armored units of the Old Administration used to break through enemy lines. Their continuous firepower can neutralize even C.O. They must be operated with caution, because the stock of their spare barrels are running low.]]
L22_1[1] = L23_1
L22_1[2] = L24_1
L23_1 = {}
L24_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_ADMIN_TANK"
L25_1 = [[
 An attacker capable of performing area attacks, temporarily enhanced upon deployment.

They are armored units of the Old Administration used to hold the line. Their high-powered beam cannons can annihilate large C.O. The equipped laser module is constantly being researched by multiple nations under the supervision of the Administration.]]
L23_1[1] = L24_1
L23_1[2] = L25_1
L24_1 = {}
L25_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FOX_ANTIAIR"
L26_1 = [[
 Although specializing in anti-air attacks, this ranged attacker can be used against anything.

It is a self-propelled anti-air gun that has been used since the mid 20th century. Armed with four 23mm machine guns, it is capable of destroying ground targets as well as the ones in the air. The radar installed in the upper part greatly helps Fennec Fox with their deficiency in surveillance equipment.
Since the vehicle's armor is weak, solo engagement can be devastating. Operate with infantry units if possible.]]
L24_1[1] = L25_1
L24_1[2] = L26_1
L25_1 = {}
L26_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FOX_HOWITZER"
L27_1 = [[
 A siege weapon that launches a concentrated attack on the key target from afar.

This self-propelled artillery unit shows excellent performance, but has some productivity issues. Its 52 caliber 155mm howitzer is powerful enough to destroy the Corrupted Objects.
Despite its outstanding capabilities, this particular model was scarcely observed in action within Fennec Fox regions, because the supply of its components fell short for quite a while.
Fennec Fox tried to abandon use of this model, but the decision was put on hold because there were no armored units to replace it. ]]
L25_1[1] = L26_1
L25_1[2] = L27_1
L26_1 = {}
L27_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FOX_ROCKET"
L28_1 = [[
 A sniper unit that specializes in subduing infantry units with ground area attacks.

It is a mid-size tactical vehicle equipped with a multi-rocket launcher. This model can't be sold to civilians, even now when the arms market has expanded. But Fennec Fox was able to acquire their share from abandoned army camps.
Fennec Fox especially cherishes these armored vehicles because they achieve extremely high kill ratio when fighting against multiple enemies.
Due to challenging maintenance, they are only deployed to the most crucial operations. ]]
L26_1[1] = L27_1
L26_1[2] = L28_1
L27_1 = {}
L28_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FOX_VEHICLE"
L29_1 = [[
 A vanguard that pushes back enemies when deployed.

They are highly mobile multi-purpose vehicle that were supplied during the Grand Purification War. They only have simple armaments, but they can rush into the combat zone to briefly stop enemy advancements.
The machine gun mounted on top enables them to engage a relatively safe battle against Category 1 C.O. For this reason, they were once used by the United Forces to maintain security around their camps.
The exhilarating ride experience remains unchanged even with an AI installed.]]
L27_1[1] = L28_1
L27_1[2] = L29_1
L28_1 = {}
L29_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FUTURE_BALLISTA"
L30_1 = [[
 Ballista is a guard that generates a barrier and uses its high ATK to hold off enemy lines.

A tactical mobile turret originally developed with air-launched ground support in mind, it provides such great firepower that it's also used to defend the ship.
Embedded with an experimental AI personality, it can become very emotional at times.]]
L28_1[1] = L29_1
L28_1[2] = L30_1
L29_1 = {}
L30_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_M_FUTURE_HARPY"
L31_1 = [[
 Janus is a variable fighter that attacks enemies from the air until it receives a certain amount of damage.

It then transforms into Janitor mode and lands on the ground to continue to fight at the front lines in a defensive position.
The prototype of a transformative robot recently developed by Future-at-War, a company renowned for its experimental technology, it's rumored to have accumulated actual battle data in secret before it was revealed to the public.
Clients who have seen its performance demonstrations seem to believe it's stable enough to be popularized. The researchers who actually developed it don't.]]
