L32_1 = [[
 Arachne is a mobile weapon developed from the Future-at-War Project. It was designed as a powerful all-around ranged attacker to counter mech units.

An autonomous AI was installed to flexibly respond to variables during anti-terror operations. Arachnes share thoughts and experiences through an exclusive network, enabling them to act like one.
Criticisms regarding the experimental self-learning AI halted the project as well as the unit's mass production, but this allowed your company to sponsor the project and take over Arachnes at a relatively low price. ]]
