L33_1 = [[
 Titan is an annihilator developed from the Future-at-War Project. It is a giant mech unit that possesses incredible capabilities to match its cost.

It was developed to counter Category 3 C.O. by itself, but the project was canceled after the budget was reallocated in accordance to the success of the North Pole operation. But there are still multiple active units in the military and the defense industry.
Originally, your company was unable to operate these units due to their high price and maintenance cost. But some of the Titans, equipped with autonomous AIs, refused to follow their orders, which allowed your company to obtain them with relative ease.]]
