L35_1 = [[
 A vanguard that performs ground area attacks from the air.

They are combat drones that fly low and drop bombs over the enemy.
They are basically Sparrows armed with a high-explosive launcher. Steel Lane introduce this model based on the market demand for Sparrows with more firepower.
Since the combat algorithm of the Sparrow's AI was hard to modify, a fire suppression AI with a partial upgrade was installed on the new model. After all, the only difference is that they drop high explosives instead of fire extinguishing bombs.]]
