L36_1 = [[
 An all-around ranged attacker that provides fire support from the air.

They are combat drones that utilize a small machinegun from low altitude.
A product of the Future-at-War Project, they are loved by soldiers for their simple structure that allows for easy maintenance. Released under an open-source license, they are still produced all around the world.
They are equipped with an AI modeled after a sparrow. Rumor has it that they can be trained like pets over time, but they are usually shot down before that, so the truth is yet to be revealed.]]
