This attack helicopter was designed to have an AI installed. Its air-to-surface Banefire missiles can effectively take down targets on the ground.
Steel Lane ambitiously prepared them as the next-generation flagship products to hit the military market dominated by Future-at-War. The 3rd generation Bowstring FCS, in particular, is renowned for its high accuracy even in harsh environments.
Although Buzzards are shunned by the market due to uncompetitive price and delayed delivery caused by production line issues, they still receive good reviews from well-informed customers.]]
