This siege tank was developed by Steel Lane to suppress large Corrupted Objects that can't be taken down with regular firepower.
It thrusts a giant drill with compressed air and gunpowder to annihilate the target. Despite their incredible power, Rhinos have long reloading time and lack close combat abilities, always requiring protection.
They were originally developed to demolish structures and flatten terrain during the post-war rebuilding, but they were repurposed for military use due to their overwhelming power. ]]
