Due to their excellent ability to traverse through rough terrain, they are able to withstand the harsh environment of the Counterside. The digital integrated combat system required for large scale operations is an optional purchase item.
But the biggest advantage of Hounds is definitely their cost-efficiency. According to consultants in the industry, they are most recommended for small companies who want to purchase their first armored unit.
Wonder what kickbacks those consultants are getting. ]]
