 A ranged attacker that deploys Scouts to ravaged areas.

This helicopter was developed for rapid force deployment. Equipped with a tactical silence generator, it can safely arrive at operation sites.
Although it has a machine gun mounted on the side, it is not very effective in combat. Instead, it automatically ejects the passenger seats upon a crash. Ever since this feature was applied, the survival rate of the soldiers in transit have sky-rocketed to 80%. ]]
