 A vanguards that push back enemies when deployed.

Chariots are combat vehicles developed to quickly establish and fortify camps in urban battles. Equipped with aluminum run-flat tires and heavy metal armor, these vehicles are as durable as a tank and can be utilized even on the frontline.
Chariots come in handy when transporting larger units such as Strongholds and Terminators who too heavy to be airlifted.
The interior is quite confined due to various equipment, but it can still be used to safely evacuate civilians who are rescued on site. ]]
