L6_1 = [[
 A siege unit that provides intensive fire support from afar at a fixed location.

They are specialized in using older mortars. Their inferior firepower compared to modern weapons is covered by high accuracy. They are very proud that they are using old-fashioned weapons while still being able to compete with other mercenaries.
They always move in a team of two or three, and the bond between the team members is very strong. They always take care of all the difficult tasks, because it is the best way to foster teamwork. ]]
