L8_1 = [[
 A ranged attacker who can efficiently take down armored ground units.

They are specialized units with expertise in anti-tank rockets. Their targets include armored vehicles, tanks, and Corrupted Objects with thick shells.
They are the most sacrificed units in battle, but the veterans always return miraculously from whatever danger they encounter.
Since they are often exposed to enemy fire, they are more superstitious than other soldiers. This explains why they never even dare to touch candy drops.]]
