L9_1 = [[
 A sniper who attacks faster after each shot.

She specializes in intercepting targets from a stationary position. While staying out of enemy attacks, she provides suppressing fire to create a safe environment for allies.
Careful and devoted, she always defends her position once given the order. There is a famous story that the enemy mistook her for dead because she stayed still even after getting shot.
Despite her cold and quiet looks, she is notorious for being a disciplinarian who keeps nagging at her comrades. ]]
