L10_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_HB_CHOIENA"
L11_1 = [[
 A guard who doesn't fight herself but turns the spotlight to an ally by significantly enhancing their abilities.

Choi Ina is a businesswoman who used to work in the entertainment industry, but she has recently quit her job to start her own NetTube business. As the CEO of Tomorrow Entertainment, a MCN of minor influencers, she also acts as a field manager to ensure Project HRT Berry's success. She is very sensitive about how she's addressed, and ruthlessly bans all viewers who refers to her as Madame.
In the show business, she used to be the classic workaholic manager. She established her own company after arguing with her superior about bringing in too much work. Nowadays, she is keeping the HRT Berry members busy with their live streams under the title of Daily Lives of Cute Counter Girls.]]
L9_1[1] = L10_1
L9_1[2] = L11_1
