L11_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_HOGSBACK_TOM"
L12_1 = [[
 Tommy the Die-hard is a defender who always accompanies suppressor Jerry and rifleman Mickey.

These three are typical mercenaries who likes to brag about themselves. United we stand and divided we fall? That's definitely NOT their motto. They are just mercenaries with mediocre skills who like to hop around the bars together.
They always exaggerate their achievements to increase their worth, but they are a tiny bit better than others in the sense that they have never betrayed their clients. ]]
L10_1[1] = L11_1
L10_1[2] = L12_1
