L12_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_ORCA_CHARLIE"
L13_1 = [[
 Charlie Rockwood is a defender who endures enemy attacks before striking a powerful counterattack with his submachine gun.

He is the typical talkative mercenary you would meet at a local bar. He was a minor football player in college. One day, Charlie met a mercenary at a bar, whose stories made him immediately pack up and leave the dorm. Having already experienced harsh training and communal life, Charlie seems more cut out to be a mercenary than a football player.
He always picks up rumors about absurd profitable gigs, but has never achieved success. But he is still dreaming of hitting the jackpot. Maybe that's why he is never intimidated on the battlefield. ]]
L11_1[1] = L12_1
L11_1[2] = L13_1
