L13_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_ORCA_EDDIE"
L14_1 = [[
 Eddie Fisher is an attacker who can efficiently lead his fellow mercenaries.

He is better known as the Negotiator in the industry. He earned his nickname because he always manages to receive the exact money from the clients who make up all sorts of excuses to cut the pay. It must be infuriating for some clients, but many people still wish to hire him because he always gets his job done.
Eddie's weapon is not his guns or explosives, but his smooth tongue and cool-headed assessment of situations. He is the best instructor when it comes to teaching a lesson to newbies who tend to risk their lives to earn some pocket money. ]]
L12_1[1] = L13_1
L12_1[2] = L14_1
