L14_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_ORCA_JESSICA"
L15_1 = [[
 Jessica Green is a vanguard who pushes enemies back with her shotgun while installing explosives.

Born and raised on a giant ranch, she had always been tired of her conservative family and the boring country life. After finally leaving her hometown on the day of high school graduation, she has been traveling around the world as a mercenary without contacting her family. Although she has never received a professional training, she is skilled at handling explosives based on her experience in farming equipment and fertilizers.
Her only flaw is that she easily gets angry. Once she loses her temper, even the veteran mercenaries are shocked by the vulgar words coming out of her mouth. ]]
L13_1[1] = L14_1
L13_1[2] = L15_1
