L16_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_SL_RIFLE"
L17_1 = [[
 An all-around ranged attacker employed in large numbers.

They are common units of Steel Lane, equipped with anti-corruption gear. Having no particular strengths or weaknesses, they are the standard infantry units utilized by private military companies.
Their main weapon is the SL-A2, which is known as an improved version of the standard rifle that has been in used by the army since 1984.
These units can be reinforced quickly due to their short training period and low maintenance cost. Because there are a lot of inexperienced recruits, they are often called the privates.]]
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
L16_1 = {}
L17_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_SL_SHIELD"
L18_1 = [[
 A defender who protects allies by provoking the enemy.

They are common infantry units that utilize riot shields. Recruits with excellent physical abilities are selected to become Shieldmans. 
They are trained to hold the frontline against enemy advancement. Although they lack firepower, their titanium-coated riot shields are strong enough to stop the Biter's claws.
They are well-trusted in the field for their core principle of never backing down. Their strong fellowship has aroused rumors that they often assemble to eat up all the food in the company's snack bar. ]]
L16_1[1] = L17_1
L16_1[2] = L18_1
L17_1 = {}
L18_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_SL_SHOTGUN"
L19_1 = [[
 A vanguard who is able to push back multiple enemies with ground area attacks.

They are specialized units that utilize SL-OSG shotguns. They require grit, agility, and quick decision-making skills, so only the most experienced personnel are welcomed to this position.
SL-OSG was a shotgun made for civilians by Steel Lane's forerunner company, Daero Machinery, and its powers were proven during the Grand Purification War.
These guns are like a symbol of Steel Lane, but their carriers are so idle in their daily lives that they are called the old veterans within the company.]]
L17_1[1] = L18_1
L17_1[2] = L19_1
L18_1 = {}
L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_S_SL_SNIPER"
L20_1 = [[
 A sniper that launches powerful long-ranged attacks from the rear.

They are specialized units that wield SL-S14 sniper rifles. Only those who received sniper training in the army are selected to take this position. They boast incredible accuracy thanks to the highly reliable SL-S14 rifles, along with HUD and gyroscope.
They use supplements to maintain extreme concentration out on the battlefield, and they will not hesitate to pull the trigger even if the enemy is right under their noses. ]]
L18_1[1] = L19_1
L18_1[2] = L20_1
