L4_1 = [[
Those consumed by Kleshas and greed cannot ascend.
They strive to soar, but never achieve anything more than circling the clouds to no end.
Wandering mid-air for an eternity left them with one thing: aimless rancor.
They shall break free from the clouds and descend in a dark manifestation.

<color=#ffd34c>Ah hah hah. Subduing one's Kleshas to reach divinity...
It all sounds like trivial nonsense to me.</color>]]
