L31_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SECURITY_CA_SERGEANT"
L32_1 = [[
Griffin Rider Christina Brecht is a supporter who weakens enemies and enhances herself with her Ultimate Skill.
Sergeant Brecht, a highly decorated Gronian soldier, was awarded the Medal of Honor in recognition of her exceptional performance during the rebel-held civil war. The soldiers on the frontlines perceived a battle alongside Sergeant Brecht as a test of valor.
Now, with her state-of-the-art Griffin unit, she is determined to become a symbol of hope for her comrades. May glory be with her as she brings about peace to Gronia while flying in her nation's airspace at hypersonic speed!
* The above post is extracted from Gronia's propaganda department.]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
L31_1 = {}
L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HARMONY_C_BASSOON"
L33_1 = [[
Plaga is a ranger specializing in enhancing her allies. The enhancement effects are greater for C.O.s and Elysium Philharmonic units.
Plaga is a performer that even members of the Elysium Philharmonic avoid. This is due in part to her introverted nature, which starkly contrasts with the other members, and her ominous atmosphere, which seems to bring about death.
This is why Plaga's performance always blends well with rain and shadows instead of the other members. The ship-horn-like, ominous tone of the contrabassoon is endowed with a magical force that induces the listener to yearn for their own demise.]]
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
