L15_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_HARMONY_CA_ARMOR"
L16_1 = [[
She was once the guardian of Elysion, a knight, and faith itself, to which everyone devoted themselves. Everyone worshipped her, and that faith turned into the strength that protected the people in return.
She had a revelation that there was an impending apocalypse and, with the Elysion Philharmonic, built the Solar Gates to repel the plague of darkness and prevent it.
Ecclesia had several orchestras and conductors beneath her. Yet she never played herself. The musical instruments were a way of expressing one's heart, and it was her responsibility to listen to and understand everyone's heart.
She enjoyed music; however, she never played for herself. She lived only to listen to others' feelings. Henceforth, the people started to call her the Great Silence.]]
L14_1[1] = L15_1
L14_1[2] = L16_1
L15_1 = {}
L16_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_MAID_C_SPEAR_PR"
L17_1 = [[
After being on a secret mission disguised as a maid, Lycoris has returned to her main job as an agent.
Working for the Administration's intelligence agency, it has been confirmed that she is on an undercover mission directed by Mark Finley. Aside from the fact that they work with various countries and organizations, no other agent's personal information or mission details have been disclosed.
Currently, Lycoris has been exposed, and it is unclear whether she will be returning to Flora Maid.
However, as diligent as she is, she will always do her best as an Administration agent and a maid.]]
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
