L40_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_CA_SHADOW"
L41_1 = [[
Eve Meitner is the object of worship in a religious sect derived from Eckhart's Society for Preternatural Research.
Her followers claim to be traitors and stop at nothing to gather the Fragments of the Lake, and they rapidly became a group more extreme than the Society.
She has the exterior of an innocent child, but her real nature is an independent entity who was separated from an unspeakable being. She is waiting for an opening to devour her mother and become one and complete.
Similar to the entity assumed to be her mother, she devours things for the accumulation of knowledge. However, she displays cruel tendencies, such as agitating the prey for new information or pushing the prey to the extreme.
It was observed to be similar to a child, killing insects in unimaginable ways.]]
L39_1[1] = L40_1
L39_1[2] = L41_1
L40_1 = {}
L41_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BD_C_ROI_PR"
L42_1 = [[
Prydwen, the legacy of a fallen world, is the symbol of the Institution and an Anti-Divinity Armament that can be used against Divine Corrupted Objects.
While standing against the Society for a long time, the members of House Burnett became a chain and passed on the shield for generations. When House Burnett fell and Robert Burnett abandoned his obligations, many Institution members thought the legend had come to an end.
But now, the shield that lost its owner has once again been placed in the hands of a Burnett.
Roy Burnett, taking on the generational task and his master's will, is no longer a kid who acts recklessly.
He is the new legend of Prydwen who takes one step forward at a time to take responsibility for his own choices.]]
L40_1[1] = L41_1
L40_1[2] = L42_1
