L28_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_DELTA_CA_JAKE_CONTEST"
L29_1 = [[
What would it be like if there were another me?
Well, he'd be ridiculously strong and probably enjoy drinking.
Hah hah. But whatever the case, he'd undoubtedly be a soldier, like me.
When people are in trouble, both he and I will be the first ones there to protect them.

<color=#ffd34c>Arriving like lightning in response to calls for help. Hah hah. Don't worry. The strongest Counter is here to protect you.</color>]]
L27_1[1] = L28_1
L27_1[2] = L29_1
L28_1 = {}
L29_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_FENRIR_C_INTERN_FOOLSDAY"
L30_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※This skin only changes the character illustration.※</color>\n\nEverything looks fun in the eyes of this new recruit who just set out on a journey.\nThere is a lot to eat and places to sightsee.\nLooks like she finally found a place she can boast to her seniors about.\nShe's all happy after taking a photo. Doesn't she look like an angel from heaven?\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Oh! There's a hot spot to show off to everyone! One, two…</color>"
L28_1[1] = L29_1
L28_1[2] = L30_1
L29_1 = {}
L30_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_OZ_S_RUNNER_FOOLSDAY"
L31_1 = "<color=#ffd34c>※This skin only changes the character illustration.※</color>\n\nThere isn't anyone on campus who doesn't know her.\nIt's hard to forget a girl running around the school, blowing her whistle.\nBut even popular people need rest.\nIt must be in her nature to still listen to her friends' requests even during breaks.\n\n<color=#ffd34c>Tie my hair up? Like this?</color>"
L29_1[1] = L30_1
L29_1[2] = L31_1
L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_SKIN_DESC_NKM_UNIT_REPLACER_C_KNIGHT_GAUNTLET"
L32_1 = [[
An arrogant knight more suited to be called a brawler.
Her maliciousness contributed in cunning schemes and nefarious conspiracies.
Even though serving the king meant being a mere chess piece.
Her reckless determination and blind loyalty shall remain steadfast.

<color=#ffd34c>Crush the weak underfoot. And trample the strong even more thoroughly.</color>]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
