L48_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_CHAMBER_S_ENGINEER"
L49_1 = [[
Spencer is an explorer who has been exploring Counterside for a long time.
She is mainly active in Chamber's Grand Dimension Crevice and collects Artifacts as a source of income. She may seem like a common treasure hunter who dives into danger for money, but she also used to be a prominent scientist who developed purified Eternium liquid in the past.
Carrying the pain of the Corruption Syndrome in exchange for surviving in the hyperdepths, she relies on medication to survive. Even with a body that could collapse at any time, she accomplishes the tasks in the hyperdepths that even veterans refuse on a daily basis.
Considering that she spends most of her income left over after covering exploration costs into information gathering, it is highly likely that she's not simply after money.]]
