L40_1 = "SI_PF_DEFENCE_BANNER_02_DESC_5"
L41_1 = [[
1. <b>Regularly Appearing Enemies:</b> Stronger enemies appear at regular intervals.

2. <b>Earning Kill Points:</b> Earn Kill Points by eliminating monsters.

3. <b>Rank Placement Priority:</b> In the event of a tie in Kill Points, the user who registered their rank first will be ranked higher.

4. <b>Deployment Range Increase:</b> All ally units have increased deployment ranges.

5. <b>Decreased Deployment Resource Gain:</b> Deployment Resources gain -30%.

6. <b>Hitstun Immunity:</b> All enemy units gain Immunity to Hitstun 2 minutes after the battle starts.

7. <b>Outgoing Healing Decrease (1st):</b> All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -60% 2 minutes 30 seconds after the battle starts.

8. <b>ASPD Increase:</b> Enemy units' ASPD increases by 100% 3 minutes after the battle starts.

9. <b>Outgoing Healing Decrease (2nd):</b> All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -80% 3 minutes 30 seconds after the battle starts.

10. <b>DMG Increase:</b> Enemy units' damage increases by 100% 4 minutes after the battle starts.]]
