L36_1 = [[
Yanikka was born into a family labeled as traitors to their country and grew up in a laboratory with no sunlight.
If she had not awakened as a Counter, she might have ended up in the same situation as her brother who was never able to leave that place.
The person who took her in said this about her: It would not be surprising if she became an outcast because of her difficult upbringing, but it is a miracle how bright she is now.
Yanikka puts her life in danger for others on the battlefield, and she donates the majority of her earnings to orphanages. Perhaps it is not a coincidence that she was chosen by the Administration and given legitimate work.]]
