L5_1 = "After every 5th attack, he is able to cancel his current move and do something else. Forces nearby units to target him and decreases their ASPD by 30% for 6 seconds. (Attack count persists through deployments.) Additionally, increases ATK and Skill Haste by 3% for every Guilty Gear unit on the battlefield in PVE (up to 18%)."
