L7_1 = "At 70% or lower HP, she sends nearby targets flying in the opposite direction from her. Hitstuns targets including those in Special Skill mode, and increases Skill Haste by 30% for 6 seconds per target (up to 90%). Immune to Damage for 2 seconds after this Passive. Additionally, increases ATK and Skill Haste by 3% for every Guilty Gear unit on the battlefield in PVE (up to 18%)."
