L15_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_JAPAN_C_CHIHIRO_PR"
L16_1 = "Gordias' Deputy Commander, first-class sword master, and the last descendent of the Hayami family... There are numerous ways of referring to her, but her sword has been known by only one name since ancient times.\nIgnis Blade.\nThe sword was forged as a replica of one of the Nether God’s swords, capable of determining its wielder's worth solely based on one's blazing mental image.\nHayami Sanae was once its owner, but she was unable to believe in herself for a long time following her family's demise. She spent years in the cold shadows of atonement, separating herself from the blade. The fact that she is back to using Ignis Edge, though, is reassuring.\nFor it demonstrates that her will is still burning brightly."
