L26_1 = [[
The swimming team's much-anticipated ace.
Was she so focused on practicing that she wore her school uniform into the pool?
Being young is beautiful. Wait, is that a mine underneath the bench...?
She's not thinking of using it during the competition, is she?

<color=#ffd34c>"Good timing. Can you help me take off my wet clothes?"</color>]]
