L27_1 = [[
The weather is getting hotter, and reality does not appear to be getting any better.
Upon waking up, you see that you have washed up on a strange white sand beach.
The girl who owns the place doesn't seem human, at all.
Is that really important, though?
Some even argue that being sane is bad for one's health.

<color=#ffd34c>"Mister, forget about the world and play with Eve. Forever."</color>]]
