L49_1 = {}
L50_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ADMIN_C_RABBIT"
L51_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
Administrator 4th Recon Division Yaksha Deputy Commander, Judy Swift, is a Bygone Counter who possesses the ability to manipulate ice.
She has a close relationship like a family with the first Commander of the division and has served as Yaksha's de facto leader in his absence. As a veteran division member who has survived the forefront of the Counterside, she tries not to lose her cool in any situation, but after witnessing the sacrifices of her comrades, she never hides her ruthlessness toward her enemies.
It is assumed that she can partially use her ancestral Bygone abilities. One thing to note is that her ice crystals significantly reduce the temperature of their surroundings. To ensure that operations run smoothly, all personnel must be equipped with cold weather gear.]]
L49_1[1] = L50_1
L49_1[2] = L51_1
L50_1 = {}
L51_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ADMIN_CA_CAT"
L52_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
Administrator 4th Recon Division Yaksha Commander, Alice Braidwood, is a Bygone Counter who possesses the ability to accelerate by short-distance space jump.
Her speed is unrivaled within the Administration, and her space jumping ability allows her to use her stylish fighting skills to intercept enemies by arriving at the forefront faster than anyone else.
As a former firefighter who was later scouted to join the Administration, her contributions to numerous operations have propelled her to the Division Commander in a relatively short period of time.
Despite the Headquarters' assessment of her as a liability to the Administration due to her spirited personality and dislike for rules, she is one of the most popular division Commanders among Administration soldiers because she is the first to jump into any battlefield and save the lives of many.]]
L50_1[1] = L51_1
L50_1[2] = L52_1
