L24_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_REAPER_M_CYBORG"
L25_1 = [[
Before Drekavac became a Matryoshka Doll, she was a kind and strong girl.
Even after becoming a Doll, the brainwashing device in her memory core didn't work on her. She even defied the doctor and killed the researchers.
She and her big sister were tortured, experiencing every sort of pain imaginable.
Drekavac's ruthless personality is presumed to have developed as a result of this process. Currently, she is showing twisted tendencies of increasing the number of Matryoshka Dolls and make them a part of her family. Even the Northern Union is wary of her, going as far as to partially disarm her.]]
L23_1[1] = L24_1
L23_1[2] = L25_1
L24_1 = {}
L25_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_SABOTAGE_CA_SWORD"
L26_1 = [[
Mavka is a combat weapon created through the Northern Union's experiments.
Every part of her body is designed for combat and has significant firepower. Her memory core, which also serves as her power source, is an unusual device. When examined, it appears to contain memories from when she was human. However, because she displays signs of identity confusion, it is assumed that the majority of her memories were fabricated.
Her name, appearance, and the memories of her closest friends... and possibly even her motivation for becoming a child soldier, could all be fictional.
Mavka awakened after receiving a Watch from her friend. Her case of a non-human awakening as a Counter may offer a new perspective on the previously established Counter rules.]]
L24_1[1] = L25_1
L24_1[2] = L26_1
L25_1 = {}
L26_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_SHASHA"
L27_1 = [[
Sasha Gagarina is an energetic girl who helps the people of Ciringrad with her ability to fix broken objects.
Given enough materials, she can create new items, and her versatility allows her to create everything from household necessities to weapons.
She is always seen smiling, but she suffers from the experimental side effects she received from the Northern Union in the past.
Nevertheless, the fact that she shows no signs of weakness in front of others may indicate that she is struggling to forget the past.]]
L25_1[1] = L26_1
L25_1[2] = L27_1
