L41_1 = [[
Yuppie is a young girl who came to the orphanage due to her complicated family history. She is a precocious child who frequently acts older than her age and helps care for the children at the orphanage, as well as a kind-hearted person who donates money earned from her work to the orphanage.
Yuppie is these kids' gentle older sister; she is devoted to them and goes above and beyond for them, even if she complains on occasion. However, there are times when her emotions get so intense that her childlike side emerges. In short, she would never get along well with a troublemaker.



]]
