L47_1 = [[
Credere is a troublemaker who causes problems everywhere she goes. Her unusual way of thinking is frequently the source of them, but for some reason, the outcomes are so positive that no one can really criticize her. Perhaps one of the reasons for her erratic behavior stems from her high self-esteem as the youngest daughter in her family, who grew up with her parents' constant attention.
Her bag contains homemade explosives, making it easy to misunderstand her, but she is really a sweetheart who genuinely cares about her friends. If she is going to cause any problems, it is better to build a trusting relationship with her by talking at her level rather than pointing out her flaws.

However, Credere necessitates constant supervision due to her habit of detonating explosives when she is in a difficult situation.]]
