L4_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_VARUNA_CA_CHAKRAM"
L5_1 = [[
Surya has no records in any database, including memories from humans. Accordingly, deducing her identity from the Unique Gear she possesses, it is assumed that she was tasked with exterminating special C.O.s that once appeared in the Normalside.
Recently, Surya has been confirmed to be working as a guide in a tour company called Varuna Tour. Her lack of expertise in history and geography and her unfriendliness to customers have gained her notoriety as the worst guide, but on the other hand, she also receives raving reviews from tourists who she saved from C.O.'s attacks.
As of now, Surya looks like she started this job to take photographs, but her exact purpose is still unclear.]]
