L37_1 = {}
L38_1 = "SI_BOSS_DESC_S3_01"
L39_1 = [[
This large C.O. causes indiscriminate destruction and predatory activities, emitting strong Corruption rays and bringing the Counterside.
It is presumed to swim through the imaginary space, and when it emerges, it overwrites the space around it into a desolate desert city.
It appears to have intelligence, as it communicates through visual and auditory hallucinations, and makes use of the various weaponry of the ship that is its core to fire beams and output significant firepower.]]
L37_1[1] = L38_1
