L42_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_ASHA"
L43_1 = "Asha is the CEO of Varuna Tour, who has mastered all of Lotus' tourist destinations.\nIt's impossible to tour Lotus as it is exposed to all kinds of crimes. However, Asha hired powerful Counters as guides and established herself as a pioneering businesswoman in Lotus. The 「Are you really not going to buy this one?」 tour package is the only tourism package that guarantees your safety in Lotus, with a survival rate close to 100%. This is also why, despite the high cost, people who want to tour Lotus safely choose Varuna Tour."
