L11_1 = "SI_PF_DEFENCE_BANNER_02_DESC_8"
L12_1 = [[
<b><color=#ffd34c>[Enemies and Kill Points]</color></b>

- <b>Regularly Appearing Enemies:</b> Stronger enemies appear at regular intervals.

- <b>Earning Kill Points:</b> Earn Kill Points by eliminating monsters depending on their level.

- <b>Rank Placement Priority:</b> In the event of a tie in Kill Points, the user who registered their rank first will be ranked higher.


<b><color=#ffd34c>[Employee Deployment]</color></b>

- <b>Deployment Range Increase:</b> All ally employees have increased deployment ranges.

- <b>Deployment Restrictions</b>: Each employee can only be deployed 1 time.


<b><color=#ffd34c>[Difficulty Increase Over Time]</color></b>

- <b>Hitstun Immunity:</b> All enemy units gain Immunity to Hitstun 1 minute after the battle starts.

- <b>Outgoing Healing Decrease (1st):</b> All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -60% 1 minute 30 seconds after the battle starts.

- <b>- Outgoing Healing Decrease (2nd):</b> All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -80% 2 minutes after the battle starts.

- <b>DMG Increase:</b> Enemy units' damage increases by 100% 2 minutes 30 seconds after the battle starts.]]
