L28_1 = [[
<color=#ffd34c>[Enemies and Kill Points]</color>

- Regularly Appearing Enemies: Stronger enemies appear at regular intervals.

- Earning Kill Points: Earn Kill Points by eliminating monsters.


<color=#ffd34c>[Employee Deployment]</color>

- Deployment Range Increase: All ally employees have increased deployment ranges.


<color=#ffd34c>[Difficulty Increase Over Time]</color>

- Hitstun Immunity: All enemy units gain Immunity to Hitstun 1 minute after the battle starts.

- Outgoing Healing Decrease (1st): All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -60% 1 minute 30 seconds after the battle starts.

- Outgoing Healing Decrease (2nd): All units are inflicted with Outgoing Healing -80% 2 minutes after the battle starts.

- DMG Increase: Enemy units' damage increases by 100% 2 minutes 30 seconds after the battle starts.]]
