L34_1 = "A beautiful cleric who assists adventurers on their journeys!\nWith her seasoned skills, vast knowledge, and gentle nature,\nshe always supports new players.\nSometimes with kindness, and other times with strictness,\nshe has the complete trust of her companions.\nShe is always accompanied by cute marimos.\nAlthough they look cute and harmless, if they detect danger,\nthey will transform into something ferocious to protect their master.\n*The above description is based on the interviews with players of 「Counters Legacy」."
