L30_1 = "The strongest Counter on earth, Naielle Bluesteel.\nShe is called the Academy's elite, the hero of humanity, and other countless monikers.\nShe has completed countless quests and brought many challengers to their knees, which generated an elegant aura that transcended the charisma of the strong.\nShe is able to freely handle thousands of weapons including her secret weapon, the True Catastrophe Blade, which is known to be the most powerful weapon ever.\nHowever, her status as an elite is not solely due to her strength.\nHer righteous character and strong desire to protect the world truly befit her title of \"elite\".\n*The above description was sincerely requested to be written by a player of 「Counters Legacy」."
