L51_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_BAR_S_BARTENDER_PR"
L52_1 = [[
Her many nicknames include the Shadow of the Holy Curia, the Devil Hunter, and the Sister with a Piercing Gaze. She is the rising star of the Vatican Exorcism Council.
Having been deployed to five Corruption disaster sites, she has consistently achieved outstanding results, earning the admiration of her fellow Sisters. She's said to be a cold and distant figure, speaking to no one but her beloved gun. But that's just a rumor.
In truth, she longs for casual conversations with other sisters. Yet, because of the hardened image she's unintentionally built, she holds back. Deep down, she just wishes someone would speak to her first for once.]]
