L26_1 = [[
<color=#ffd34c>* This skin only changes the character illustration. *</color>

A question from her friends, directed at the one who's rumored to know everything.
Her visor flickers with shifting expressions, a sign that this problem might be tougher than usual.
But there's no such thing as an unsolvable problem for her.
As the anticipation builds, she makes up her mind, shrugs off her coat, and boldly makes her statement.

<color=#ffd34c>Based on my network search, the best possible conclusion is this.</color>]]
