L28_1 = [[
<color=#ffd34c>* This skin only changes the character illustration. *</color>

Her day always begins the same way, by offering food to her friend.
But today, her fickle friend doesn't seem too pleased with the menu.
The moment she lets her guard down, her friend, now free of his muzzle, starts scouting for something else to munch on.
And, well... it seems her outfit has become the next best option.

<color=#ffd34c>W-wait?! Toto! You can't do that here!</color>]]
