L39_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_CA_BLUE"
L40_1 = "Lucia Ridge is an exorcist who specializes in handling hauntings.\nPeople instinctively fear the unknown, and Lucia exploits this by presenting these fears as hauntings, heightening their terror. When fear reaches its peak, she steps in under the guise of exorcism, deceiving people into buying overpriced holy water, making forced donations, and engaging in other fraudulent schemes. Most of her victims don't even realize they've been swindled.\nThe reason Lucia Ridge is so desperate for money is simple. She needs it to cure her sickness. No one knows what sickness she suffers from, but the fact that she disappears every full moon and is based in the Valentinus Monastery suggests that whatever it is, it’s far from ordinary."
