L39_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_C_GOETIA"
L40_1 = [[
Katharina once believed that prayer alone could achieve anything. She tried to quench her burning thirst with grape juice and sought forgiveness through confession, hoping the curse would be lifted. But she soon realized that prayer alone would never be enough.
Just as she once left her homeland in search of a cure, Katharina has now turned her back on the Holy Curia once more, determined to break the curse. Her new companions may be heretics, secretive and suspicious, and far from trustworthy, but they understand her plight better than anyone. Suppressing the bloodthirst brought on by her curse is no easy feat. But as long as those who share her resolve stand beside her, Katharina will endure.]]
