L2_1 = "SI_PVP_UNLIMITED_SEASON_RULE_V4"
L3_1 = "<b><color=#4EC2F3>[Max Level Capped And Gear Not Applied Season]</color></b>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Gear stats are not applied during the Gear Not Applied Season.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- During the Max Level Capped Season, the following conditions will apply.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Employees will be Lv. 120 with Max Skill Level, Tactical Update Lv. 6, and Reactor unlocked.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Operators will be Lv. 100 with Command Skill Lv. 8 and Side Skill Lv. 11.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Ships will be Lv. 100.</color>\n\n<b><color=#4EC2F3>[Unlimited]</color></b>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Users can compete with each other during the season.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- This Week's Bans & Ups are not applied.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Users will earn more points for winning and lose fewer points for losing when matched against opponents with higher Victory Points.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Users will earn fewer points for winning and lose more points for losing when matched against opponents with lower Victory Points.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- When matched against an opponent with a Victory Point difference above a certain threshold, the maximum or minimum possible Victory Points could be earned or lost.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Upper-tier Leagues are accessible after earning a certain amount of Victory Points.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Users in Bronze – Diamond League will not lose Victory Points upon losing.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Users in certain Leagues can be demoted from their League if their Victory Points go below the league's minimum point requirement by 1 or more.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- {0} points will be deducted during the Settlement period if 48 hours have passed since the last match, and {1} points will be deducted every day thereafter, which may lead to League demotions. The point deduction rule will stop once a match is played during this period. The Victory Point deduction rule does not apply to {2} points or lower.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Matches will be unavailable during the Victory Point Settlement period, between 00:00–{3}:00 (UTC+9) every day.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Rewards will be given based on the final Victory Points once the season ends and the Settlement period begins.</color>\n\n<b><color=#4EC2F3>[Unlimited Combat Environment]</color></b>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Only 10% of HP, ATK, and DEF increased from gear and growth is applied.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- CRIT DMG RES +50% and 20% Max DMG Taken Limit are applied to SSR ships.</color>\n<color=#FFFFFF>- Outgoing Healing Decrease reaches up to 80% depending on the remaining time.</color>"
