L49_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_RAT"
L50_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
Justine Macy is the lead engineer and technical specialist of the Administration 4th Recon Division Yaksha.
A prodigy recognized by the Administration at a very young age, she was scouted into the Weapon Development Bureau as its youngest recruit. However, choosing fieldwork over a workshop, she accepted an offer from Commander Lionel and transferred to the Yaksha Division, a unit made up of fellow Bygones, to contribute to anti-Corruption warfare.
Although Justine's early success made her a bit arrogant and quick to look down on others, Yaksha members still see her as the beloved youngest member of the Division.
She loves chocolate-covered sunflower seeds, to the point that the Yaksha Division has a custom of offering her a handful as a bribe whenever they need her help with their gear.]]
