L27_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_FENRIR_CA_INTERN"
L28_1 = [[
(This text was personally written by a Class 1 Administrator.)
The Tree of Sephiroth. The total embodiment of Counter Reality Force. While countless hypotheses exist regarding the law of creating a world, its true nature has never been revealed throughout history. To date, the only confirmed trace discovered by the Administration is a remnant of Sephira found somewhere on the dark side of the moon.
Regardless of how it happened, the girl known as Noelle Wright is believed to have been directly created by the Tree of Sephiroth. Though she possesses the power to cause a change in reality simply by existing, she is also a curious and justice-driven ordinary girl. Taking that into consideration, it has been decided to observe her growth for the time being.
Perhaps the appearance of this girl following the Qliphoth Game is proof that the world itself possesses a kind of homeostasis, a natural drive to repair itself.]]
