L18_1 = {}
L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_GRACE"
L20_1 = [[
Grace, heir to the noble House of Birmingham, serves as the Star Guide of the Empire of Arcadena. Her prestigious family is known for creating numerous Unique Gears that played a vital role in the Empire's salvation. Gifted from a young age, she rose to serve as the Empire's Chief Strategist. Her integrity and diligence have earned deep trust from both citizens and subordinates. However, her unpredictable, though harmless, antics have made her a subject of concern within the Empire.
Notably, her habit of bursting into passionate flamenco dances at imperial balls requires strict supervision.]]
L18_1[1] = L19_1
L18_1[2] = L20_1
L19_1 = {}
L20_1 = "SI_SKILL_NAME_OPR_GRACE"
L21_1 = "Gloria Asterism"
L19_1[1] = L20_1
L19_1[2] = L21_1
L20_1 = {}
L21_1 = "SI_SKILL_DESC_OPR_GRACE"
L22_1 = "Grants <color=#ffd34c>DMG Taken AMP +{value1}%</color> to <color=#ffd34c>all enemies</color> for <color=#ffd34c>{time} seconds</color> (Bosses excluded). This effect <color=#ffd34c>can't be canceled</color>. Then [#UNIT_OPR_GRACE_SUMMON#] inflicts <color=#ffd34c>AoE damage equivalent to an Ultimate Skill</color> near the ally ship, on the entire battlefield (Valid Hits: 3, Cannot inflict damage to the enemy ship in Gauntlet). The first time he inflicts AoE damage, grants <color=#ffd34c>DMG AMP +{value2}%</color>. After each activation, <color=#ffd34c>value is doubled</color> (up to 96%)."
L20_1[1] = L21_1
L20_1[2] = L22_1
L21_1 = {}
L22_1 = "SI_DP_KEYWORD_DESC_UNIT_OPR_GRACE_SUMMON"
L23_1 = [[
Basic Stat (PVE / PVP)
ATK: 12000 / 2400
CRIT: 900 / 900
HIT: 900 / 900
Unaffected by other units and Operators.]]
L21_1[1] = L22_1
