L47_1 = [[
In the past, the Northern Union launched the Sputnik Space Expedition to investigate a mysterious phenomenon on the dark side of the moon. To train units capable of enduring extended missions in the unforgiving void of space, they partnered with Mansion. Eleven explorers were ultimately selected and sent into orbit, but all official records of them were erased.
Now, Kudryavka, the last surviving member of the Sputnik expedition, dons on her space suit once more to confront her past and save a dear friend. Little did she know that the special suit would bring back her humiliating past she had hoped to forget.]]
