L13_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ZODIAC_CA_CHARLOTTE"
L14_1 = [[
Esterosa de Chevalier is the captain of the Zodiac Knights, who use the Blessing of the Stars.
Once a drifter who had lost her sense of justice, she learned to harness the power of the starlight sealed within her Armament through the legend of the Guide. In doing so, she shaped an Armament that reflected her ideals.
Though not born into a noble knightly house, Esterosa carries the will of her predecessors and has earned the unwavering support of her comrades, even while facing resistance from the tradition-bound elders.
Since her return to the Order, some say she's begun to show a more girlish side, a sharp contrast to her once stern and solemn demeanor. She worries it may affect morale, but other knights are simply relieved to see the weight on her shoulders beginning to lift.]]
