L32_1 = [[
Medea is a former Knight of Aries from House Davis. She once served on the front lines of Blue Shift alongside Julia Leonhardt, but voluntarily stepped down after the former Captain vanished. Medea personally mentored Yang Hansol, a member of a branch family, preparing him to join the Order as her successor. She hopes that one day, he'll become a capable knight who can take on the burdens of the household.
Despite her adorable appearance, Medea is cool-headed and calculating. She often acts as a gentle, fragile noblewoman to avoid troublesome duties. But this act has ironically earned her a reputation as an upright person, resulting in more responsibilities than she intended.]]
