L51_1 = "Where does the path of life lead? Even if footprints are left behind in the snow, once they've vanished, who can say which way was east or west? Some have already died and now stand as towers. Walls have crumbled, leaving no path back to the past. Do you still remember the hardships of days gone by? The road was long, the people weary, and even the mules cried."
