L46_1 = [[
<color=#ffd34c>Objective</color>
- Defeat as many C.O.s as possible to achieve a high score.
<color=#ffd34c>Controls</color>
- Tap the left or right side of the screen to attack in that direction, using Naielle as the center point.
<color=#ffd34c>Rules</color>
- C.O.s will charge at Naielle from both sides of the screen.
- Each time you reach a certain score, a boss C.O. will appear. Boss C.O.s can withstand more hits than regular ones.
<color=#ffd34c>Defeat</color>
- If a C.O. reaches Naielle, you lose.
- If Naielle attacks when there is no C.O. within the attack range, you lose.]]
