L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ZODIAC_C_ARROW"
L33_1 = [[
Carantisir de Letaria is the Captain of the Zodiac Knights Red Shift, a faction that prioritizes the pursuit of personal profit above all else. Once a devoted knight who held chivalry sacred, he became warped by a deep-seated inferiority toward the former Blue Shift Captain and the internal crises that fractured the order. His obsession with strength led him to uncover the true nature of the Star Armaments and begin researching starlight long before anyone else. His belief that strength alone should rule twisted his once-brilliant mind into ruthless cruelty.
Though he bears the title of Captain, not everyone in Red Shift trusts him. Still, in a faction where skill reigns supreme, no one dares challenge his authority.]]
