L32_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ADMIN_CA_CLOUD"
L33_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
A swordswoman born of Dragon Blood has the power to cut down the evil called the Beast. But the cunning ones do not wait like trees to be struck and must be fought head-on.
Yeonhwa was born with that gift. She could commune with another self within her mental realm. She swiftly mastered the swordsmanship invented by the early cohorts of the Administration, and from a young age, had already attained mastery of the Sword of Paramita.
Her only flaw was a heart too easily swayed. Perhaps it was the many personas that lived inside her mind.
But in the end, those worries proved unfounded. She earned her place in the Trivanguard Special Task Unit, as if fate had always led her there.]]
