L3_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_LEEJISOO"
L4_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
Believed to have been caught in a major Corruption event during the Grand Dimension Crevice incident. Like most of the abandoned, she was first contacted by Felix's liaison. It is unknown what exactly happened afterward, but she's recently been spotted assisting with Nostalgia Workshop operations.
Despite having no physical injuries, she continues to cover her eye.
It seems that every machine she touches breaks down, which often puts her at odds with the workshop owner. She's cynical and stubborn, but considering how long they've worked together, there must be more to her than meets the eye.]]
