L50_1 = "If life had a flavor, don't you think it'd be astringent like a persimmon? The longer it hangs and ripens, the sweeter it gets, slowly covering up that sharp bite. Kind of like how life works, isn't it? Haha, I can be surprisingly poetic when I try."
