L41_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ATELIER_C_TIMEBLADE"
L42_1 = "(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)\nA scientist who, in just one year, created inventions in Chamber that will go down in history. Then, one day, he left the city with nothing but a motorbike and set up a workshop in the wilderness. There, he spent years building assistive devices for people with disabilities. Because of this altruistic work, most people laughed off the rumors that he was building a time machine.\nBut upon investigating his past, evidence linking him to the Administration was uncovered. Based on that and the nature of the rumors, we suspect he is the same person as the □□ we have been tracking.\nAwaiting further instructions on how to proceed."
