L6_1 = [[
Andrea Vesca runs a workshop dedicated to inventing assistive tools for children with disabilities.
Nostalgia Workshop doesn't stop at supplying assistive tools to orphanages, but also customizes bikes, researches cosmetics, experiments with fusion cuisine, and even dabbles in fashion design. If it's fun and fabulous, she's all in.
Her Counter ability is no exception. After mixing chemical compounds with CRF, she turns what used to be a terrifying explosion ability into a dazzling firework show. The flames are still hot enough to melt C.O. armor, but that's strictly on a need-to-know basis.]]
