The world changed after the Administration Failure exposed the true nature of the Administration. Adapting quickly to this new reality, adventurers set out to explore ruins and relics across the globe. People call them Treasure Hunters.
Though the industry is notorious for eccentrics, Mi Rinae only began making a name for herself recently. Yet eyewitnesses whisper that behind her cheerful demeanor lie uncanny movements and outrageous methods, fueling rumors she may in fact be a highly seasoned pro.
Most recently, she has been confirmed working as a P.E. teacher at the Administration Counter Academy. As instructed, preparations are underway to reach her through secure lines.]]
