L16_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_NATALIA"
L17_1 = [[
Natalia Risova is a bright and warm-hearted young girl from the frozen lands of the Northern Union. Though her enthusiasm often gets ahead of her words, her slight stutter only adds to her charm, making her all the more endearing to those around her.
Gifted with the ability to resonate with machines, Natalia is rarely seen without Fluffox, the robotic fox she built herself. Equipped with advanced functions far beyond her years, Fluffox often handles the challenges that Natalia's young hands cannot, serving as both her proudest creation and closest companion.
Recently, she has been seen accompanying Felix, the Chief of the General Staff of the Northern Union, at several official events. Some have accused Felix of using the young girl's innocent image as a political tool, but no official statement has been made on the matter.
As always, Felix simply greets Natalia with that same faint, unreadable smile.]]
L15_1[1] = L16_1
L15_1[2] = L17_1
