L21_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ZODIAC_C_SCISSORS"
L22_1 = [[
Knight of Cancer, Ascella Procenica, is one of the more recently confirmed members of Red Shift.
In the past, an incident within the Zodiac Knights caused Red Shift to lose most of their strength. Under a new captain, the order was re-formed, not for the sake of hollow noble houses or titles, but to uphold the logic of strength to restore order to the world, even if their actions would be branded as rebellion. The very fact that they exist is proof that the starlight itself acknowledges them.
Like the rest of Red Shift, little is known about Ascella's personal background. Yet one truth remains clear. Though she hails from neither the Twelve Houses nor the ranks of proper knights, she can still wield a Star Armament. In other words, even if her massive scissors are nothing more than a replica, the starlight core within them has unmistakably recognized her worth.]]
