L34_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ESPR_CA_KNIGHT"
L35_1 = "A newly formed religious faction that splintered from the Eckhart's Society for Preternatural Research, the Children of Yaldabaoth. \"Knight of the Lake\" is the title of their leader, a figure who worships the Lake of Knowledge.\nAfter the great purge within the Society, these self-proclaimed traitors attacked secret quarantine facilities worldwide to reclaim the Fragments of the Lake, rapidly growing their power. Ruthless in their methods, they have since been declared wanted by every Administration.\nLittle is known about the Knight of the Lake himself, except that he is a man of unknown origin. However, given his intimate knowledge of top-level secrets regarding the Old Administration's Camelot Division and the Prydwen Institution, as well as the fact that he calls himself the Knight of the Lake, he is suspected to have ties to House ■■."
