L25_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_DOGABI"
L26_1 = [[
(This text was restored by a Class 1 Administrator.)
A former cohort of the Administration and current leader of the Trivanguard Special Task Unit, an elite group composed of Dragon Bloods. He oversees sword training and recruits talent through divination, using rituals to trace threads of fate. He was once hailed as one of the legendary Three Blades, but no one can recall ever seeing him actually draw his sword.]]
