L30_1 = {}
L31_1 = "SI_BIRTHDAY_MAIL_DESC_3"
L32_1 = [[
This is Hilde, Commander of Fenrir Squad.
So today's your birthday? Let me start by saying happy birthday.
I owe you plenty, and I'm not someone who forgets a debt.
There were times we faced so much that I'd forget my own birthday, or even the date.
Still, having someone remember yours... maybe that saying is true. Live long enough and you see all kinds of things.
Anyway, happy birthday. Make it a good one.]]
L30_1[1] = L31_1
L30_1[2] = L32_1
L31_1 = {}
L32_1 = "SI_BIRTHDAY_MAIL_TITLE_4"
L33_1 = "Happy Birthday."
L31_1[1] = L32_1
L31_1[2] = L33_1
L32_1 = {}
L33_1 = "SI_BIRTHDAY_MAIL_DESC_4"
L34_1 = [[
Hello, Boss. This is Joo Shiyoon of Fenrir Squad.
Happy birthday. So today is your special day.
For me, birthdays have always felt both happy and a little sad.
You see... I've never really had a proper birthday of my own.
I used to hope someone might say something to me, but all I remember is standing there alone.
Maybe that's why even a small well-wish feels so precious to me now.
I hope today becomes a day where you receive many heartfelt wishes.]]
L32_1[1] = L33_1
L32_1[2] = L34_1
L33_1 = {}
L34_1 = "SI_BIRTHDAY_MAIL_TITLE_5"
L35_1 = "Good for you, Boss."
L33_1[1] = L34_1
L33_1[2] = L35_1
L34_1 = {}
L35_1 = "SI_BIRTHDAY_MAIL_DESC_5"
L36_1 = [[
Vice President Lee Sooyeon here.
You don't need to go around making a fuss because it's your birthday.
If you kept quiet, I would have taken care of it myself.
I know how heavy the load on your shoulders is,
and I know you want at least one day to breathe a little.
So for today, I will say it. Happy birthday.
But taking the time to celebrate also means you have enough room to handle your duties, doesn't it?
I trust you won't let anything slip.]]
L34_1[1] = L35_1
L34_1[2] = L36_1
