L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_FUTURE_M_TITAN_PR"
L20_1 = "The Jupiter Plan had once been dismissed as pure idealism, a paper scheme with no path to reality. Although Dr. Sergei Chernov abandoned it under the weight of real-world constraints, he preserved it for the future he believed would one day arrive. That legacy eventually returned to its original proposer, Renée Maalouf, allowing the Hyperion Plan to finally come to light.\nThe Hyperion Plan's Helios System amplifies the anti-gravity field generated by the Eternium Drive, letting its massive frame overcome all terrain limitations. Its newly installed Aether Particle Cannon and Perses Missiles grant it the ability to deliver strategic bombardment against any target in its sights. Titan has now become an intercontinental strategic aerial fortress, ready to safeguard humanity wherever danger appears. After completing Hyperion's improvements, Renée Maalouf left the following note in her research journal.\n─「Carrying on your will, for a future where our children will be strangers to war.」"
