L39_1 = [[
I just want to get closer to Squire... isn't there some good way to do that?
A teamwork improvement manual? This might be exactly what I need!
Mm... Drink together until they're tipsy, and bring them back to the room?
Then lock the door, and slip the key where your feminine confidence lies...

<color=#ffd34c>By the time Robin realized the book's cover had been switched, everything was already in motion.</color>]]
