L41_1 = [[
Wearing the outfit her members prepared for her, Esterosa stepped before you, perfectly composed at first.
But the knights overlooked one important detail.
Even the strongest captain can suddenly become unsure of what to do when she finds herself alone with someone inside a Ferris wheel.
In this moment, the dignified captain has turned back into a shy girl, fidgeting with the gift box behind her, unable to hide her awkward expression.

<color=#ffd34c>I seem nervous? W-well... It's my first time... being alone with you like this...</color>]]
