L9_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_FENRIR_CA_HILDE_PR"
L10_1 = "Your Hilde, that child was once the finest warrior. So I gave her wings and let her be reborn as a Valkyrie, one who guides the fates of warriors. I even granted her a new name. Freyja. Pride born of divine power and a noble purpose. For a time, she fulfilled her role flawlessly alongside the other Valkyries. That is, until she realized what fate awaited warriors led by a Valkyrie... ■■.\nOnce she learned the truth, she began to doubt that pride she once held so dear. She tore off the wings she loved with her own hands, and turned away from the calls of the warriors who followed her. From the moment she severed her bond with the sun, she began to chase you, the moon, through the darkness. But I do not consider her a traitor.\nYou know it too, don't you? Fate can only ever flow the way it was first decided."
