L15_1 = [[
Minha Investigation Log #24_ Followers of the Flies crave rotten flesh. They rarely speak, and when they mutter, it sounds like wind leaking through cracks in skin. ...Gross.
Those with proper vocal organs are called Heralds. They convey the will of the swarm and wear a conch shell on their face as a mark. What lies behind that shell... I never want to know.]]
