L17_1 = "After the death of an Official Counter, the Senior passed the position on to her successor. She had hoped the successor would carry on the duty left behind by someone dear to her. Instead, the successor chose revenge. Even so, the Administration neither condemned nor expelled her. Whatever her reasons, the target she pursues is also an enemy of the Administration."
