L47_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_G1_C_TAOIST"
L48_1 = [[
Minha is a Counter who underwent a unique body-and-mind discipline of the Orthodox Sect. She revered her master, Master Taeyu, as a father figure, but after his sudden death, she inherited the heavy title of Ground One's Official Counter. Yet vengeance outweighed responsibility. Ignoring her post, she left Ground One and began wandering the world in search of her master's killer.
Despite this, her reputation is surprisingly positive for someone driven by revenge. Stories remain across the world of her saving countless lives during Corruption disasters, only to disappear without a trace.
This is likely the result of her master's peculiar teachings of the Orthodox Sect. She can't ignore those in distress and feels genuine elation when thanked.
Minha finds this part of herself troublesome. Still, if someone needs her tomorrow, she will set vengeance aside and lend her strength without hesitation.]]
