L19_1 = "You looked at my resume? H-Hey, knowin' my experience is enough! Why are you, like, snooping through my file?! Yeah, okay, we had fields and farms, but it wasn't like we lived in the middle of nowhere! They even sold burgers in town, okay?! Idiot!"
