L36_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_OPR_CREW"
L37_1 = [[
Mary Crew is the matriarch of the prestigious Crew family of Front Bay.
She is known as the supportive wife of the Eastern Coast Guard Commander and the strict mother of three daughters. Despite her refined appearance, she has often taken the lead in difficult work herself, earning a reputation as a noble lady who truly practices noblesse oblige. However, as with anyone of prominence, envy follows. Rumors claim that Mary Crew was once a member of the infamous Avery Pirates. The Crew family dismissed this as nonsense, but people still seem to treat it as an entertaining bit of gossip.]]
