L46_1 = [[
You come face to face with a fragment of the past you have seen so often it has long since grown tiresome.
This is a fragment of a destroyed world drawn forth by the Counterside.
Those who once merely passed through your memory, those you were meant to remember, grip their weapons even tighter.]]
