L46_1 = "SI_EXPLORE_EVENT_MAINDESC_80060_2"
L47_1 = [[
The eyes of warriors facing death are always resolute.
That's why they must be remembered.
Just as you repeat this to yourself and prepare to order a dimension jump, a brilliant white light flashes across the sky and strikes down before them.
That light may prove to be of great help as you explore the Counterside. Or it may be nothing more than an illusion.
Your squad awaits your command.]]
