L6_1 = {}
L7_1 = "SI_EXPLORE_EVENT_MAINDESC_80061_2"
L8_1 = [[
A girl carrying a burden so heavy it would be understandable if she chose to run away at any moment.
And yet she continues to look forward with the eyes of a warrior. She never looks back.
If only you could give her even a small push forward.
Perhaps you could lend her your strength.]]
