L19_1 = "SI_COLLECTION_UNIT_INTRO_NKM_UNIT_ANAPILIS_CA_SCYTHE"
L20_1 = [[
Anapilis was the name of one of the seven Promised Lands passed down in her world. But as she walked the traces left after the end, she came to learn that the Promised Land had always been one from the beginning, differing only in the names people gave it and the ways they chose to see it.
With the power of the Golden Tree, she made the world bloom anew and gathered everyone's scattered faith into one. That unity was not born from philosophical discourse or lofty persuasion. They accepted a single Promised Land by following revenge, the most primal of human emotions, one that stands at the very opposite of nobility.
And so, she became the Promised Land.]]
